#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:583
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged GitHub plugin version [v2.2.0](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-github/releases/tag/v2.2.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:584
msgid "The first emoji is now auto-selected in the emoji picker."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:585
msgid "Added Markdown support for batched email notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:586
msgid "Users’ timezone is now used in batched email notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:587
msgid ""
"Removed a conflicting class (``help-text``) from the interactive dialog "
"field description to resolve the black text color in the dark theme."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:588
msgid "Updated the user interface of **Team Settings** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:589
msgid ""
"Promoted Simplified Chinese to Beta, and downgraded Hungarian and Spanish"
" languages to Beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:590
msgid "Improved the opening animation of the user settings modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:593
msgid ""
"Upgraded ``@mattermost/client`` and ``@mattermost/types`` to support "
"TypeScript v5.x."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:594
msgid ""
"Enforced safety limit in compiled Team Edition and Enterprise Edition "
"deployments when enterprise scale and access control automation features "
"are unavailable, and when the count of users who are registered, but not "
"deactivated, exceeds 11,000. ERROR_SAFE_LIMITS_EXCEEDED."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:595
msgid "Dropped pre-packaged plugins for unsupported OS and architectures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:596
msgid ""
"Implemented a new **Export Settings** page in the **System Console** to "
"allow Cloud administrators to customize their dedicated export S3 "
"buckets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:597
msgid "LDAP job details are no longer shown until the job runs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:598
msgid "Added more logging to the ``NotificationsLog``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:599
msgid ""
"A message is now logged when a user tries to log in using an incorrect "
"password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:600
msgid ""
"Posts from deactivated users are now included in **Direct Message** "
"channel exports. Also the ``--include-archived-channels`` flag is now "
"respected for **Direct Message** channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:601
msgid ""
"Changed the cache headers for file endpoints to cache privately for 24 "
"hours, instead of not caching at all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:602
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:791
msgid ""
"Improved the performance of the ElasticSearch indexing job in PostgreSQL "
"installations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:603
msgid "Moved following functions from server to public utils:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:604
msgid "``ResetReadTimeout``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:605
msgid "``AppendMultipleStatementsFlag``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:606
msgid "``SetupConnection``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:607
msgid "``SanitizeDataSource``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:610
msgid "mmctl can now be used to download a Support Packet using ``--local mode``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:611
msgid ""
"mmctl system ping will now return detailed server status even if the "
"server status is unhealthy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:614
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Desktop App login flow would erroneously show "
"the landing page for first time users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:615
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a right-hand side card was not reloaded when the "
"card body was updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:616
msgid "Fixed an issue where ``en-AU`` language selection was not allowed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:617
msgid "Fixed an issue with the position of text in the default profile picture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:618
msgid "Fixed an issue with the group search to parse the display name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:619
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where items with longer text did not widen the user guide "
"dropdown to its max-width."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:620
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the configuration could not be updated from the "
"**System Console** in cloud environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:623
msgid ""
"A new setting option was added to ``config.json``. Below is a list of the"
" addition and its default value on install. The setting can be modified "
"in ``config.json``, or the System Console when available."
msgstr ""

