msgid "Under ``CloudSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:627
msgid ""
"Added a new configuration setting ``Disable`` (via config.json, or "
"environment variable), default ``false``. When set to ``true``, all "
"requests to the Mattermost Customer Portal from a workspace will be "
"disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:630
msgid "Added ``stylelint`` to https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/."
msgstr ""

