msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where deactivated members were not included in a favorited"
" **Direct Message** channel export."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:700
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where password strength settings wouldn't be disabled if "
"they were set through environment variables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:701
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where post mentions would grow outside the viewport on "
"small devices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:702
msgid "Fixed an issue with draft removal after deleting the post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:703
