"Fixed an issue where a sender to a custom group would also receive the "
"message notification themselves."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:705
msgid ""
"Fixed a web app crash when a System Admin clicked on a link to a private "
"channel that they were not a member of."
msgstr ""

