"retention now runs without concurrency in order to avoid any performance "
"degradation. Added a new configuration setting "
"``DataRetentionSettings.RetentionIdsBatchSize``, which allows admins to "
"to configure how many batches of IDs will be fetched at a time when "
"deleting orphaned reactions. The default value is 100."
