#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1255
msgid "Never Miss Group Messages Again"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1256
msgid ""
"Group messages (GMs) now behave like direct messages (DMs). [The badge "
"count increases for every new "
"message](https://docs.mattermost.com/collaborate/channel-types.html"
"#group-messages)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1258
msgid "Convert Group Messages to Private Channels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1259
msgid ""
"Added the ability to [convert a group message to a private "
"channel](https://docs.mattermost.com/collaborate/convert-group-"
"messages.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1261
msgid ""
"See [this walkthrough video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dbHg-63J9dA)"
" on the highlights and some of the below improvements in our latest "
"release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1266
msgid "Added a **Cancel** button to the **Delete category** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1267
msgid "Added the ability to resize the channel sidebar and right-hand sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1268
msgid ""
"Added two new filtering options (show all channel types and show private "
"channels) to the **Browse channels** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1269
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged GitLab plugin version [v1.7.0](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-gitlab/releases/tag/v1.7.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1270
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1514
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2112
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged Calls plugin version [v0.20.0](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-calls/releases/tag/v0.20.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1271
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged Playbooks version [v1.39.0](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-playbooks/releases/tag/v1.39.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1272
msgid ""
"Added additional reaction options when viewing threads or messages when "
"the sidebar is larger than its minimum width."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1273
msgid ""
"Added a link to [notification "
"documentation](https://docs.mattermost.com/preferences/manage-your-"
"notifications.html) in the **Notification Settings** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1274
msgid "Updated the post textbox measurement code to be more reliable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1275
msgid "The ``/invite`` slash command now supports custom user groups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1276
msgid ""
"Re-enabled the remote marketplace functionality, when configured as per "
"``PluginSettings.EnableRemoteMarketplace`` "
"[documentation](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure/plugins-"
"configuration-settings.html#plugins-enableremotemarketplace)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1279
msgid "Added ``mattermost-plugin-api`` into the ``mattermost`` GitHub repository."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1280
msgid "Updated the public server module version to v0.0.9."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1281
msgid ""
"Added 2 new URL parameters to ``GET /api/v4/groups``: "
"``include_archived`` and ``filter_archived``. Added the ability to "
"restore archived groups from the user groups modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1282
msgid "Added file storage information to the support package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1283
msgid ""
"A ``user_id`` is now included in all HTTP logs (debug level) to help "
"determine who is generating unexpected traffic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1284
msgid ""
"Added new URL parameter to ``GET /api/v4/groups`` and ``GET "
"/api/v4/groups/:group_id``. ``include_member_ids`` will add all the "
"members ``user_ids`` to the group response objects. You can now also add "
"group members to a channel, any members that are not part of the team can"
" be added to the team through this flow and subsequently added the "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1286
msgid "Plugin Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1287
msgid ""
"Added new frontend plugin extension point for the new messages separator "
"bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1288
msgid "Added a new plugin extensibility point to add actions to the code blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1289
msgid "Added the plugin hook ``UserHasBeenDeactivated``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1290
msgid ""
"Added a new server side plugin API method to set the searchable content "
"for file info (``SetFileSearchableContent``). The "
"``MessageHasBeenPosted`` plugin hook is now executed after the "
"attachments are linked to the post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1293
msgid ""
"Fixed keyboard support for the left-hand side channel menu, the left-hand"
" side category menu, and the post dot menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1294
msgid "Fixed display name in the ``comment_on`` component."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1295
msgid "Fixed an issue with keyboard support for some menus with submenus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1296
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with disappearing punctuation when following a group "
"mention."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1297
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1542
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where compliance export jobs were not able to start after "
"disabling and enabling the compliance export."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1298
msgid "Fixed a potential read after write issue when loading a license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1299
msgid ""
"Fixed the API to block any changes to direct and group messages names, "
"display name, or purpose."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1305
msgid ""
"Removed ``ServiceSettingsDefaultGfycatAPISecret`` and "
"``ServiceSettingsDefaultGfycatAPIKey`` configuration settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1306
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5491
msgid "Under ``TeamSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1307
msgid ""
"Added a new config setting ``EnableJoinLeaveMessageByDefault`` that sets "
"the default value for ``UserSetting``, ``ADVANCED_FILTER_JOIN_LEAVE``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1308
msgid "Under ``DisplaySettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1309
msgid ""
"Added a setting ``MaxMarkdownNodes`` to limit the maximum complexity of "
"markdown text on mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1311
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1599
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1820
msgid "Changes to Enterprise plan:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1313
msgid ""
"Added a new configuration setting ``RetentionIdsBatchSize``, which allows"
" admins to to configure how many batches of IDs will be fetched at a time"
" when deleting orphaned reactions. The default value is 100."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1316
msgid ""
"Added the ``X-Forwarded-For`` request header to the audit stream for all "
"Rest API calls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1317
msgid ""
"Added API endpoint ``POST /api/v4/user/login/desktop_login``. Modified "
"OAuth/SAML flows to include ``desktop_login`` where applicable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1318
msgid ""
"Added new API endpoint ``GET`` ``/api/v4/channels/<channel-"
"id>/common_teams`` to fetch list of teams common between members of a "
"group message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1319
msgid ""
"Added new API endpoint ``POST`` ``/api/v4/channels/<channel-"
"id>/convert_to_channel`` to convert a group message to a private channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1320
msgid "Added a new ``MessageHasBeenDeleted`` hook to the plugin API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1321
msgid "Moved the ``request`` package into the public shared folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1324
msgid "v9.1 is built with Go ``v1.20.7``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1327
msgid ""
"Converting a group message to a channel should show an error \"A channel "
"with that name already exists on the same team\" for duplicate channel "
"names [MM-54713](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-54713)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1328
msgid ""
"Marking a group message as unread doesn't resurface the numbered "
"notification badge "
"[MM-54778](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-54778)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1329
msgid ""
"Thread/posts jump when switching to and from preview mode "
"[MM-54758](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-54758)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1330
msgid ""
"Desktop UI doesn't show all content when the right-hand side thread is "
"opened [MM-54696](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-54696)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:1331
msgid ""
"Left-hand side resize option overrides the **Browse/Create Channel** menu"
" if To-Do plugin is installed "
"[MM-54367](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-54367)."
msgstr ""

