msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2020
msgid ""
"Additional Compliance APIs to return the history of boards and blocks, "
"including deleted items (available in Mattermost Enterprise Edition and "
"above)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2025
msgid "Prepackaged Calls v0.14.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2026
msgid "All post components were removed in favor of a unified approach."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2027
msgid ""
"App bindings are now refreshed when a App plugin-enabled event gets "
"triggered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2028
msgid "Improvements were added to the sidebar channel and category menus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2029
msgid "Removed right-click hijacking on code blocks in messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2030
msgid ""
"The order of the Leave Channel and Archive Channel settings were updated "
"to match the mobile app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2031
msgid ""
"Added the condition to remove unread styling for archived channels and to"
" filter archived channels from local data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2032
msgid "Changed the collapsed post fade out effect to be less buggy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2033
msgid ""
"Users now have the ability to see the history of edited messages and to "
"restore an old message version with the current version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2034
msgid "Improved the user interface of the user profile popover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2037
msgid ""
"Boards cards are no longer mentioned as being limited in the **System "
"Console**, the limits usage modal, the downgrade modal, or the left-hand "
"side menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2038
msgid "Removed unused ``ProductLimits.Integrations``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2039
msgid "Export files now contain the read and unread status for channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2040
msgid ""
"Added an error message when running an LDAP sync with ``SyncEnabled`` set"
" to ``false``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2041
msgid "Added Admin log table filtering and sorting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2042
msgid ""
"GraphQL APIs are now correctly counted when measuring performance "
"telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2043
msgid ""
"Added a dynamic call-to-action under **System Console > Site Statistics "
"and > Team Statistics** for air-gapped and non-air-gapped systems. The "
"banner reminding about true-up follows the schedule [outlined "
"here](https://docs.mattermost.com/about/self-hosted-subscriptions.html"
"#quarterly-true-up-report)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2044
msgid ""
"Screened self-hosted purchases now block the Admin from re-attempting a "
"purchase for three days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2047
msgid ""
"Reduced the rate that unreads are resynced when the window is focused "
"from ten seconds to two minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2048
msgid "The center channel is no longer shown as loading when switching teams."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2049
msgid ""
"Added logging fixes: empty ``short_message`` for Gelf formatter is no "
"longer allowed and ``params.Host`` is now used over ``params.IP`` for "
"syslog config."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2052
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the System Console link to purchase a self-hosted "
"license would get stuck showing the in-product purchase progress modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2053
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the true-up notification in the invite modal did not"
" render the call-to-action correctly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2054
msgid ""
"Fixed new teams to use the updated translation for default channels after"
" a configuration change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2055
msgid "Fixed a layout issue in the System Console for smaller-sized tablets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2056
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a \"plugin configured with a nil SecureConfig\" "
"warning was logged when starting each plugin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2057
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where portal availability was checked when not on "
"Enterprise edition."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2058
msgid "Fixed an issue where C# syntax highlighting was not working."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2059
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where incoming webhooks changed the user's activity while "
"the user was offline/away."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2060
msgid "Fixed an issue where usernames were not clickable in the right-hand side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2063
msgid ""
"Added an ``exclude_files_count`` parameter to exclude file counts from "
