#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2525
msgid ""
"Mattermost v7.5.0 contains a medium severity level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-"
"server.html) to this release is recommended. Details will be posted on "
"our [security updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 "
"days after release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2529
msgid ""
"Adds a new schema migration to ensure ``ParentId`` column is dropped from"
" the ``Posts`` table. Depending on the table size, if the column is not "
"dropped before, a significant spike in database CPU usage is expected on "
"MySQL databases. Writes to the table will be limited during the "
"migration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2530
msgid ""
"For ``PluginRegistry.registerCustomRoute``, when you register a custom "
"route component, you must specify a CSS ``grid-area`` in order for it to "
"be placed properly into the root layout (recommended: ``grid-area: "
"center``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2533
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v7.4, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

