msgid "Updated the minimum version of Chrome and Edge to v106+."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2542
msgid ""
"Added new message threads with emoji reactions and @mentions to calls. "
"After joining a call, expand the widget to the window mode, and then "
"select the comment button to access the real-time message thread in the "
"right-hand sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2545
msgid ""
"Added additional standard [board templates](https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/end-user-guide/project-management/work-with-boards.html#choose-a-board-"
"template) to help users kick-off their next projects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2546
msgid ""
"Filters now support all [text properties](https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/end-user-guide/project-management/work-with-cards.html#work-with-"
"property-types)."
msgstr ""

