msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2550
msgid ""
"Added a [“Last active” status](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.html#share-last-active-"
"time) to the profile popover and to the **Direct Message** channel header"
" that indicates when a user was last online. This status only displays "
"for users who are Away, Offline, or in do-not-disturb (DND). This can be "
"disabled via **Settings > Display > Share last active time**."
msgstr ""

