#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2652
msgid ""
"Release v7.4 - [Feature Release](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade"
"/release-definitions.html#feature-release)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2654
msgid "**v7.4.1, released 2022-12-21**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2655
msgid ""
"Mattermost v7.4.1 contains low to medium severity level security fixes. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-"
"server.html) to this release is recommended. Details will be posted on "
"our [security updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 "
"days after release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2656
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3001
msgid ""
"Added a new schema migration to ensure ``ParentId`` column is dropped "
"from the ``Posts`` table. Depending on the table size, if the column is "
"not dropped before, a significant spike in database CPU usage is expected"
" on MySQL databases. Writes to the table will be limited during the "
"migration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2657
msgid "Updated prepackaged Boards version to 7.4.3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2658
msgid "**v7.4.0, released 2022-10-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2659
msgid "Original 7.4.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2661
msgid ""
"Mattermost v7.4.0 contains a medium severity level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-"
"server.html) to this release is recommended. Details will be posted on "
"our [security updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 "
"days after release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2666
msgid ""
"Added new [board roles](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide"
"/project-management/share-and-collaborate.html#roles), **Commenter** and "
"**Viewer**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2667
msgid ""
"Added [minimum default board roles](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/project-management/share-and-collaborate.html#manage-team-access) "
"to reduce permissioning ambiguity and to prevent security loopholes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2668
msgid ""
"Added support for [guest accounts](https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2669
msgid ""
"Added the ability to add a team member to a board by selecting their name"
" from [an autocomplete list](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide"
"/project-management/work-with-cards.html#mention-people)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2670
msgid "Added channel notifications for linked boards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2671
msgid ""
"Added a new [multi-person property](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/project-management/work-with-cards.html#work-with-property-types) "
"to easily set multiple assignees or owners on a card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2674
msgid ""
"Added new [keyboard shortcuts for Calls](https://docs.mattermost.com"
"//end-user-guide/collaborate/keyboard-shortcuts.html#calls)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2679
msgid ""
"Added a red destructive action color to the **Leave Channel** button in "
"the channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2680
msgid "Downgraded Brazilian Portuguese and Romanian language support to Alpha."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2681
msgid "Pre-packaged Playbooks v1.32.6."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2684
msgid ""
"A ``batchSize`` option has been added to the ``mattermost export`` CLI "
"command to limit the number of items exported. By default, if it is not "
"included, it exports all posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2685
msgid ""
"Added more context to the “Notify admin” feature to help Admins, such as "
"who asked to upgrade, why they requested the upgrade, and how many people"
" requested it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2688
msgid "Fixed an issue with a nil point exception error during imports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2689
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where users were unable to download a [Support "
"Packet](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/manage/admin"
"/generating-support-packet.html) using the Desktop App."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2690
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with the **Message forward** modal where the auto-complete"
" in the comment box moved with the text cursor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2691
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2807
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where muted channels with an at-mention were displayed "
"under the **Unreads** section of the channel switcher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2692
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Collapsed Reply Threads setting was displayed in"
" the **System Console > Experimental Features** section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2693
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with the badge count on the mobile app when a "
"channel/thread was viewed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2694
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where typing ``@`` in the right-hand side rendered a cut-"
"off user suggestion list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2695
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where an error screen was briefly flashed when the first "
"Admin signed up into a new server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2696
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where users were unable to add Japanese comments correctly"
" in the message **Forward** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2697
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where unsaved edits to a post were lost when switching "
"channels or threads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2698
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on larger screen sizes where the Insights widgets were "
"pushed to the side when the right-hand side was open."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2699
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the ability to forward messages from public channels"
" wasn't possible when messaging someone directly for the first time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2700
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where custom emojis were sometimes not visible in "
"**Insights > Top Reactions**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2701
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where channels with no posts within a particular timeframe"
" didn't show in **Insights > Least Active Channel**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2702
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Channel Info right-hand side shortcut was not "
"disabled in the Insights view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2703
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where an in-product link was missing from **Integrations >"
" Bot Accounts > Add Bot Account**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2704
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2745
msgid ""
"Reverted the new search of names in PostgreSQL using full text search "
"introduced in v7.3.0 due to a performance regression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2711
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableAPITriggerAdminNotifications`` to add an option to receive "
"more context from the “Notify admin” feature to help Admins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2714
msgid ""
"If ``EnableConfirmNotificationsToChannel`` is disabled, channel member "
"counts by group API are no longer called."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2717
msgid "Added ``OmitConnection`` to the websocket broadcast parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2720
msgid "v7.4 is built with Go ``v1.18.1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2723
msgid ""
"The **More** menu for Pinned posts on the right-hand side is cut-off "
"[MM-46987](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-46987)."
msgstr ""

