msgid ""
"Updated the \"Contact Sales\" link to ``mattermost.com/pl/contact-sales``"
" and update the pricing modal user interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2788
msgid ""
"Introduced a new ``/marketplace`` slash command that brings up the "
"marketplace modal for the Admin, and changed the ``/help`` command so "
"that it now keeps the user internal to Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2789
msgid ""
"Team unreads are now calculated based on the channel membership and "
"threads only. Team membership is no longer taken into account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2790
msgid ""
"For introducing Boards and Playbooks to new users, an “explore other "
"tools in platform” item was added to the end user onboarding checklist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2791
msgid "Added the **Save** option to the post menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2792
msgid ""
"Only the most recent message is now marked as unread when marking a "
"thread as unread from the Threads list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2793
msgid ""
"Insights filters now persist instead of being reset to default when "
"switching to channels and returning back to the Insights view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2794
msgid ""
"Code blocks now have better support for language filetype extensions and "
"are a smaller bundle size."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2795
msgid ""
"A Desktop App prompt is now always shown on first visit to a Mattermost "
"server from an email notification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2796
msgid "Search dropdown options now allow focusing by pressing the tab key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2797
msgid "Downgraded Bulgarian language support to Beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2800
msgid ""
"Added a **View Plan** button within the plan card via **System Console > "
"License**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2801
msgid ""
"Started tracking the join time of team members and added a new API "
"endpoint to retrieve information about team members who have joined "
"during a given time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2802
msgid ""
"Introduced an optional ``shouldRender`` function parameter to "
"``registerchannelHeaderMenuAction`` plugin function. This allows menu "
"items to conditionally render depending on the current state prior to "
"rendering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2803
msgid ""
"Plugins can now hide plugin settings based on the server's hosting "
"environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2804
msgid ""
"Customers who are on a 30-day free trial are now notified three days "
"before the trial ends."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2808
msgid "Fixed an issue where starting a trial failed if ``SiteURL`` was not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2809
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where reading a thread on the mobile app caused a negative"
" mention count to display on the web app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2810
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the user's profile image persisted after user "
"account deletion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2811
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where exports generated via mmctl without attachments "
"still included the file properties in the post, so they couldn't be "
"imported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2812
msgid "Fixed an issue that caused a crash when unread posts were fetched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2813
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where updating a profile image and creating new emojis "
"used multipart uploads when using S3 storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2814
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the input legend on the custom group modal was cut "
"off in Chrome."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2815
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Disable post formatting** setting was hidden "
"when the advanced text editor was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2816
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where we didn’t fall back to the user's default picture if"
" a profile picture failed to load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2817
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where disabling a WebApp plugin from its configuration "
"page resulted in the radio button reverting to ``true``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2818
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the cursor sometimes jumped to the center channel "
"textbox when the right-hand side was open."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2819
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where closing the right-hand side also closed the edited "
"post in the center channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2820
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where selecting \"Try free now\" opened the top three "
"enterprise features instead of the \"Your trial has started\" modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2821
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Threads view displayed as unread even if there "
"were no unread threads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2822
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where configuration changes could not be saved in the "
"**System Console** in some cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2823
msgid ""
"Fixed typos in some translations that caused some in-product links to be "
"broken."
msgstr ""

