#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2894
msgid ""
"You can now easily share messages as permalinks and respective permalink "
"previews via the new [Post Forwarding "
"feature](https://docs.mattermost.com/channels/forward-messages.html). "
"Simply select the new **Forward** option from the **More** section of the"
" message hover actions menu on a given message, choose a desired "
"destination, and optionally add a comment for context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2896
msgid "Audit Log v2 (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2897
msgid ""
"Added support for new [schema and output log "
