msgid ""
"Added the ability for Admins to quickly view different paid license "
"options inside the product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2916
msgid "Added the ability to start a trial from the **Invite People** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:2917
msgid ""
"Admins are now able to search for channel IDs via **System Console > User"
" Management > Channels** page."
msgstr ""

