#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3781
msgid ""
"The value of ``ServiceSettings.TrustedProxyIPHeader`` defaults to empty "
"from now on. A previous bug prevented this from happening in certain "
"conditions. Customers are requested to check for these values in their "
"config and set them to nil if necessary. See more details "
"[here](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure/configuration-settings.html"
"#trusted-proxy-ip-header)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3157
msgid ""
"Upgrading the Microsoft Teams Calling plugin to v2.0.0 requires users to "
"reconnect their accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3160
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v6.7, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3165
msgid "Collapsed Reply Threads (General Availability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3166
msgid ""
"[Collapsed Reply Threads](https://docs.mattermost.com/channels/organize-"
"conversations.html) is now generally available. Please reference [this "
"article](https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/6880701948564-Administrator-s-guide-to-enabling-Collapsed-"
"Reply-Threads) for more information and guidance for enabling the "
"feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3168
msgid "Calls (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3169
msgid ""
"[Native voice calling and screen "
"sharing](https://docs.mattermost.com/channels/make-calls.html) is now "
"available. This is a Channels-specific integration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3171
msgid "Apps Bar (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3172
msgid ""
"Channel header is now decluttered when a new configuration setting via "
"**System Console > Experimental > Features > Enable App Bar** is enabled,"
" to make it more obvious how to access Calls, Playbooks, and Boards when "
"viewing a channel. All channel header icons registered by plugins will be"
" moved to the new Apps Bar when the configuration setting is enabled, "
"while Calls remains in the channel header. We recommend enabling the Apps"
" Bar for servers with Calls enabled since the Apps Bar helps make space "
"for the dedicated **Start Call** button in the channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3174
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3290
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4076
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4640
msgid "Playbooks Updates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3175
msgid ""
"Users can now easily keep processes up-to-date with [the inline playbook "
"editor](https://docs.mattermost.com/playbooks/customize-a-playbook.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3176
msgid ""
"A new statistics dashboard was added that displays the number of "
"playbooks and run instances within the server alongside other system "
"statistics in the **System Console**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3177
msgid ""
"Run triggers and actions now provide more control over where [status "
"updates are "
"posted](https://docs.mattermost.com/playbooks/customize-a-run.html) "
"throughout a run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3179
msgid "Message Formatting Toolbar"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3180
msgid ""
"The [new formatting toolbar](https://docs.mattermost.com/channels/format-"
"messages.html#use-the-messaging-formatting-toolbar) makes Markdown "
"accessible to everyone with easy to use controls for commonly used "
"message formatting, such as bold, headings, links, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3185
msgid ""
"For toggling the channel information in the right-hand pane, a shortcut "
"CTRL/CMD+ALT+I was added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3186
msgid ""
"Added an \"Unread Channels\" section to the channel switcher and included"
" threads in the results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3187
msgid ""
"Users are no longer hidden from search results in the \"Add members\" "
"modal, even if they are already members of the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3188
msgid "Applied new designs for the Login screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3189
msgid "Enabled the new onboarding task list for end users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3190
msgid ""
"The legacy **Settings > Advanced Settings > Preview Pre-release "
"Features** setting is now deprecated in favor of the the new formatting "
"toolbar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3191
msgid "Romanian language support was downgraded to Beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3194
msgid ""
"Improved the performance of aggregate queries related to Collapsed Reply "
"Threads. Learn more about these server performance optimizations in [this"
" article](https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/6880701948564-Administrator-s-guide-to-enabling-Collapsed-"
"Reply-Threads)."
msgstr ""

