#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3197
msgid ""
"To keep users in Mattermost when opening documentation links from the "
"**System Console > Plugin** settings page, all the links now open in "
"another tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3198
msgid "Changed **Actions** post menu hover text to **Message Actions**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3199
msgid "Updated Apps Framework to version 1.1.0 to add improved logging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3202
msgid "Timestamps are now enabled in the default audit configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3203
msgid ""
"The Collapsed Reply Threads configuration option was moved in the "
"**System Console** from **Experimental** to **Site Configuration > "
"Posts**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3205
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3317
msgid "Enterprise Subscription"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3206
msgid "Upgraded the minor version of the ElasticSearch development Docker image."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3207
msgid ""
"The Support Packet now contains two additional fields in the "
"``support_packet.yaml`` file: Active users and License-supported users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3210
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with ADA Accessibility where screen readers did not TAB to"
" or read \"This channel has guests\" in the channel header bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3211
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the @mention autosuggest of users was no longer "
"grouped by channel membership status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3212
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the New Messages toast was not fully tappable in "
"narrow view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3213
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the shortcut modal for channel info showed ``ALT`` "
"instead of ``SHIFT`` for Mac."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3214
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Help > Report a Problem** link was not hidden "
"when a URL was not set for **System Console > Customization > Report a "
"Problem**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3215
msgid "Fixed an issue with the timing of selector performance metrics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3216
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the S3 **Test Connection** button deceptively failed"
" unless the user pressed **Save** first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3217
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Workspace Optimization did not load in the System "
"Console on subpath servers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3218
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where an error was logged when ``SendEmailNotifications`` "
"was not set to ``true``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3225
msgid "Changed ``SessionLengthWebInDays`` to ``SessionLengthWebInHours``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3226
msgid "Changed ``SessionLengthMobileInDays`` to ``SessionLengthMobileInHours``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3227
msgid "Changed ``SessionLengthSSOInDays`` to ``SessionLengthSSOInHours``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3228
msgid ""
"The value of ``TrustedProxyIPHeader`` defaults to empty from now on. A "
"previous bug prevented this from happening in certain conditions. "
"Customers are requested to check for these values in their config and set"
" them to nil if necessary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3229
msgid ""
"Added ``always-on`` and ``default-on`` settings to **System Console > "
"Posts** for Collapsed Reply Threads. When enabled (default-on), users see"
" Collapsed Reply Threads by default and have the option to disable it in "
"**Settings**. When always on, users are required to use Collapsed Reply "
"Threads and can't disable it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3230
msgid ""
"The default for ``CollapsedThreads`` has been changed to ``always_on``. "
"This change impacts new Mattermost deployments, and doesn't affect "
"existing configurations where this value is already set to some other "
"value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3232
msgid ""
"Added a new config setting ``EnableAppBar`` to enable and disable the new"
" Apps Bar. This setting is disabled by default, but we recommend enabling"
" the Apps Bar for servers with Calls enabled since the Apps Bar helps "
"make space for the dedicated **Start Call** button in the channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3235
msgid ""
"Added new API endpoints ``GET /api/v4/teams/:team_id/top/channels`` and "
"``GET /api/v4/users/me/top/channels`` to get top channels for a team and "
"user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3238
msgid ""
"Added a new ``ConnectionId`` field to ``model.WebsocketBroadcast`` that "
"allows broadcasting a message only to a specific connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3241
msgid "v7.0 is built with Go ``v1.18.1``."
msgstr ""

