"[promoted to general availability in Q2 2022](https://mattermost.com/blog"
"/collapsed-reply-threads-ga). Learn more about these [performance "
"considerations here](https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/4413183568276-What-to-expect-when-enabling-Collapsed-Reply-"
