#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3431
msgid "Added nested previews for permalinks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3432
msgid ""
"Added a right-hand side Channel Info panel to see and interact with "
"channel information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3433
msgid "Added support for inline editing of posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3434
msgid ""
"Changed the Mattermost indigo theme to match the dark theme in code "
"blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3435
msgid ""
"Updated in-product links from legacy domain about.mattermost.com to "
"mattermost.com."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3436
msgid "Made it easier to copy code blocks by adding a copy button on hover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3437
msgid "Made it easier to copy a message via a new **Copy Text** post menu item."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3438
msgid ""
"Added a loading indicator to the **Threads** global list each time more "
"posts are fetched on infinite scroll."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3439
msgid ""
"Added search guidance to the **Threads** global list when no more posts "
"can be loaded. This is only shown if you’ve scrolled to load older posts "
"and reach the end of the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3440
msgid "Added accessibility support for custom statuses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3441
msgid ""
"Tooltip is now only displayed when text is too long in the announcement "
"banner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3442
msgid ""
"When restricting direct messages to users on the same team, bots are now "
"excluded from that restriction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3443
msgid "Brazilian Portuguese language support was downgraded to Beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3446
msgid ""
"Improved performance when clearing notifications with Collapsed Reply "
"Threads enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3447
msgid ""
"Improved performance of Collapsed Reply Threads when ``ThreadAutoFollow``"
" is enabled but ``CollapsedThreads`` is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3448
msgid ""
"Fixed a potential memory leak in the sidebar when using accessibility "
"hotkeys."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3449
msgid ""
"Virtualized the emoji picker and added other performance improvements to "
"the emoji picker."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3450
msgid "Improved the performance of storing users in webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3451
msgid "Fixed a small memory leak in the **System Console**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3454
msgid ""
"Updated the plugin registry's ``registerCallButtonAction`` method to "
"allow for displaying custom calls buttons in the channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3455
msgid ""
"Added a debugging setting to turn off client-side plugins for the current"
" user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3456
msgid "Added performance metrics related to plugin loading on page load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3459
msgid ""
"The default for "
"[``ThreadAutoFollow``](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure"
"/configuration-settings.html#automatically-follow-threads) has been "
"changed to ``true``. This does not affect existing configurations where "
"this value is already set to ``false``; however, we recommend enabling "
"``ThreadAutoFollow`` if you plan to enable [Collapsed Reply "
"Threads](https://docs.mattermost.com/channels/organize-"
"conversations.html) in the future."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3460
msgid "Improved the license upload flow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3461
msgid ""
"The Start Trial CTA presents a modal exposing the benefits the client "
"gets by starting the trial, encouraging Admins to request a trial license"
" and engage them with the product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3462
msgid ""
"A new field was added to the client configuration to let clients know the"
" database schema version of the server. The applied database migrations "
"have also been added to the **System Console**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3463
msgid ""
"Added a ``Automatically Follow Threads`` configuration setting to the "
"**System Console** to expose the ``threadAutoFollow`` config setting to "
"the User Interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3464
msgid ""
"An error is now shown on the email invitation modal if SMTP is not "
"configured but email invitations are ``true``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3465
msgid ""
"Logs from third-party libraries are now included in the default logging "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3466
msgid "Added additional performance debugging settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3467
msgid ""
"The support email field has moved from **Customization** to "
"**Notifications** in the System Console. Also, a support email is now "
"required when configuring email notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3468
msgid ""
"The ping endpoint can now receive a device ID, which will report whether "
"the device is able to receive push notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3469
msgid ""
"[Feature flags](https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/server"
"/feature-flags/) are now automatically refreshed when the server "
"undergoes a restart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3470
