"Added a sort order to the category API, and included category data in the"
" websocket category update event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3471
msgid ""
"Permissions for private playbooks are now hidden unless running an "
"Enterprise license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3474
