#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3493
msgid "Fixed the positioning of the post menu in mobile web view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3494
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where closing the keyboard shortcut modal by \"CTRL/CMD + "
"/\" didn’t work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3495
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the channel keyboard navigation was broken in the "
"Threads view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3502
msgid ""
"The default for ``ThreadAutoFollow`` has been changed to ``true``. This "
"does not affect existing configurations where this value is already set "
"to ``false``."
