#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3547
msgid "Updated the recommended minimum supported Firefox version to v91+."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3550
msgid ""
"The ``mattermost version`` CLI command does not interact with the "
"database anymore. Therefore the database version is not going to be "
"printed. Also, the database migrations are not going to be applied with "
"the version sub command. [A new db migrate sub "
"command](https://docs.mattermost.com/manage/command-line-tools.html"
"#mattermost-db-migrate) is added to enable administrators to trigger "
"migrations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3553
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v6.4, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3558
msgid "Custom User Groups (Beta; Professional and Enterprise Plans)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3559
msgid ""
"Added the ability to mention a group of members at a time in a workspace."
" Users can create groups, edit group details, join groups, archive "
"groups, and add group members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3561
msgid "Cross-team Channel Navigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3562
msgid ""
"You can now find and jump to channels across all your teams by typing any"
" channel name in the **Find Channels** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3564
msgid "Workspace Optimizations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3565
msgid ""
"System Admins can now review their overall health and growth scores and "
"take recommended actions for ensuring their workspace is running "
"smoothly, so users can get the most out of Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3568
msgid "Added a new onboarding tour for Playbooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3569
msgid ""
"Existing playbooks can now be duplicated by copying and modifying your "
"colleague’s processes. Playbooks can also be exported."
msgstr ""

