#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3572
msgid "Added a new onboarding tour for Boards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3573
msgid "Improved the share boards user interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3574
msgid ""
"A link to Boards is now included in the channel intro whenever a new "
"channel or direct message is started."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3575
msgid "Added in-app links to import Help Docs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3580
msgid "Added Persian as an official supported language (Beta)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3581
msgid "Added a new onboarding experience for first System Admin user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3582
msgid ""
"Added new tutorial tours for Channels, Boards, and Playbooks to help "
"orient first time users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3583
msgid "Removed extra telemetry events that were tracked during page loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3584
msgid "Added a feature card slide for Playbooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3585
msgid ""
"Removed ``admin-advisor`` bot's ability to notify admins about missing "
"support email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3586
msgid ""
"Clarified in-product error string \"Oops!\" as \"Unable to continue\" for"
" both translators and target audiences in cases where a user doesn't have"
" sufficient permissions to add users or guests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3587
msgid ""
"Removed incorrect in-product string text from the **Send full message "
"contents** email notification option description displayed via **System "
"Console > Site Configuration > Notifications**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3588
msgid ""
"Added the ability to send an unsanitized user to the source user on "
"``user_updated`` event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3589
msgid "In the compact view, the sender's username is now always shown on posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3590
msgid "The post menu is now only rendered on the root post on hover over."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3591
msgid ""
"Updated a library used for storing drafts and other data in browser "
"storage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3592
msgid ""
"Enabled performance telemetry tracking for production deployments not "
"running in developer mode. This telemetry tracking is disabled when "
"telemetry is toggled off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3593
msgid ""
"Inactive server email notifications will now be sent to System Admins "
"occasionally if there have been no telemetry events on their server for "
"100 hours or more. Inactivity is determined by reviewing all activity on "
"the server. This feature can also be disabled using the "
"``MM_FeatureFlag_EnableInactivityCheckJob`` feature flag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3596
msgid ""
"Improved database performance when ``ThreadAutoFollow`` is enabled but "
"``CollapsedThreads`` is disabled. Learn more about ``ThreadAutoFollow`` "
"and Collapsed Reply Threads [here](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure"
"/configuration-settings.html#collapsed-reply-threads-beta)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3597
msgid ""
"Improved perceived typing performance by moving heavy code around and "
"effective memoization related to the textbox component."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3598
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3796
msgid "Fixed a memory leak caused by the post textbox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3599
msgid ""
"Reduced the number of menu components listening for keyboard and mouse "
"events."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3600
msgid ""
"Re-rendering of ``CustomStatusEmoji`` component is now avoided on post "
"hovering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3601
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3797
msgid ""
"Removed the collapsed sidebar menu from the DOM on sidebar collapse and "
"expand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3602
msgid ""
"Re-rendering of ``TextBox`` links component below the post box while "
"typing is now avoided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3605
msgid "Added an ``OnInstall()`` plugin hook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3606
msgid "Added an ``OnSendDailyTelemetry()`` plugin hook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3607
msgid ""
"Added a new plugin registry entry to append menu items to the user guide "
"dropdown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3610
msgid "Fixed an issue with clicking images in the message attachment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3611
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue that caused Rudder to create their cookies on the top-"
"level domain when Mattermost was installed on a subdomain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3612
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where **Total Posts** and **Active Users With Posts** "
"graphs did not render in **System Console** > **Team Statistics**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3613
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where telemetry events attempted to get sent even when "
"blocked by an ad blocker."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3614
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the channel switcher stopped showing search results "
"when the first few characters were removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3615
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where notification sounds didn't trigger on the Desktop "
"App for new accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3616
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where users got multiple sounds for a single notification "
"on the Linux Desktop App."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3617
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where posting frequent messages to followed threads caused"
" jittery typing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3618
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Add to channel** permission was available in "
"private channels for non-admin users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3619
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the reply notification setting was still in effect "
"even when Collapsed Reply Threads was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3620
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where running ``mmctl config migrate`` reset the "
"configuration settings to defaults if the settings were already in the "
"database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3621
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the custom status menu option was missing the \"x\" "
"to clear status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3622
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the password reset link was valid for 1 hour instead"
" of 24 hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3623
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Mattermost import failed if an export contained "
"a soft-deleted team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3624
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where search results in the right-hand side did not clear "
"when changing screens from file results to any other."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3625
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where an emoji import failed when the emoji name "
"conflicted with a system emoji."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3626
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Edition and License** page displayed a prompt "
"to upgrade to Enterprise for servers that already had an E20 license."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3633
msgid ""
"Added a new ``EnableClientPerformanceDebugging`` setting to enable some "
"options for users on the web app to enable and disable different parts of"
" the web app to help us isolate performance issues while debugging."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3634
msgid ""
"Added a new ``EnableCustomGroups`` setting to create and delete custom "
"groups and to add and remove custom group members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3637
msgid ""
"Added new endpoint GET /api/v4/users/invalid_emails. This endpoint will "
"return a list of non-guest users who are not in your whitelisted domains "
"on a server where EnableOpenServer is false."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3638
msgid ""
"Added new API endpoint ``POST /system/onboarding/complete`` to complete "
"onboarding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3639
msgid ""
"Added a new API endpoint ``GET api/v4/latest_version`` to fetch the "
"latest Mattermost version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:3640
msgid ""
"Modified an existing API endpoint "
"``${baseUrl}/api/v4/channels/search?system_console=false`` and added "
"additional parameters ``${baseUrl}/api/v4/users/me/channels`` to fetch "
"all the channel across teams and "
"``${baseUrl}/api/v4/users/${userId/channel_members`` to fetch all the "
"channel_members across teams)."
msgstr ""

