#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4049
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4206
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4504
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4787
msgid ""
"Removed real-time updates of a couple of features to prevent overloading "
"servers on user updates. The \"This channel contains guests\" indicator "
"and the number of timezones displayed when notifying members of a group "
"will only be updated on channel change now."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4051
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with Focalboard where an empty white screen appeared in "
"Mattermost desktop app on reload."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4052
msgid "Fixed an issue where v6.1 reported an incorrect mmctl version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4053
msgid "**v6.1, released 2021-11-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4054
msgid ""
"Mattermost v6.1.0 contains low level security fixes. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-"
"server.html) to this release is recommended. Details will be posted on "
"our [security updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 "
"days after release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4057
msgid ""
"Please refer to [the schema migration "
"analysis](https://gist.github.com/streamer45/997b726a86b5d2a624ac2af435a66086)"
" when upgrading to v6.1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4058
msgid ""
"The Bleve index has been updated to use the scorch index type. This new "
"default index type features some efficiency improvements which means that"
" the indexes use significantly less disk space. To use this new type of "
"index, after upgrading the server version, run a purge operation and then"
" a reindex from the Bleve section of the System Console. Bleve is still "
"compatible with the old indexes, so the currently indexed data will work "
"fine if the purge and reindex is not run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4059
msgid ""
"A composite index has been added to the jobs table for better query "
"performance. For some customers with a large jobs table, this can take a "
"long time, so we recommend adding the index during off-hours, and then "
"running the migration. A table with more than 1 million rows can be "
"considered as large enough to be updated prior to the upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4060
msgid ""
"For PostgreSQL: ``create index concurrently idx_jobs_status_type on jobs "
"(status,type);``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4061
msgid "For MySQL: ``create index idx_jobs_status_type on Jobs (Status,Type);``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4065
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v6.0, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

