"issues](https://docs.mattermost.com/messaging/organizing-"
"conversations.html#known-issues),  particularly relating to database "
"resource requirements and server performance implications. If you cannot "
"easily scale up your database size, or are running the Mattermost "
"application server and database server on the same machine, we "
"recommended waiting to enable Collapsed Reply Threads until it's "
"[promoted to general availability in Q2 2022](https://mattermost.com/blog"
"/collapsed-reply-threads-ga/). Learn more about these [performance "
