msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4513
msgid "Original 5.39 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4515
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.39.0 contains a low level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) to "
"this release is recommended. Details will be posted on our [security "
"updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after "
"release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4520
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4795
msgid ""
"Updated in-product help documentation to fix broken links and to correct "
"outdated information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4521
msgid ""
"Italian, Polish, Korean, and Ukrainian languages have been downgraded to "
"alpha. Korean and Ukrainian are [no longer actively "
"maintained](https://handbook.mattermost.com/contributors/join-"
"us/localization#translation-quality)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4524
msgid "Fixed a possible panic during license validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4525
msgid "Fixed an issue with loading of emojis in message attachment titles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4526
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the timestamp in deleted messages was not correctly "
"positioned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4527
msgid ""
"Changed the whitespace in the refresh bar so that it always displays to "
"the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4528
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where email invites were not sent when clicking the "
"**Next** button during onboarding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4529
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where clicking \"View Message\" in an email did not "
"navigate to the post or remember the user's preference to \"View in "
"App\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4530
msgid "Fixed an issue with the detection of certain collapsible images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4531
msgid ""
"Prevented users from having the unreads filter enabled when the button to"
" toggle it was not shown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4532
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Mattermost's shortcut key CTRL+SHIFT+A to open the "
"**Account Settings** clashed with Chrome's CTRL+SHIFT+A that opens a "
"\"Search Tabs\" pop-up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4533
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash when markdown images were present on the message "
"attachments and embedded bindings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4534
msgid "Fixed an issue that kept message attachment fields unaligned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4535
msgid "Fixed an issue with right-hand side ``SuggestionList`` positioning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4536
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Mattermost panicked on ``docx`` files uploaded with "
"``.doc`` extension."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4537
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug with the auto-responder where it would incorrectly calculate "
"the time interval and never send the message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4538
msgid ""
"Fixed a decoding problem for OpenID integration. The requests are now "
"decoded against ``RawURLEncoding``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4540
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a gap appeared between the first and second "
"consecutive message from the same user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4541
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the thread unread state would not update on "
"websocket reconnect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4542
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the main channel view root post timestamp added a "
"horizontal scrollbar on hover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4543
msgid ""
"The ``ThreadAutoFollow`` setting must now be enabled in order to enable "
"``CollapsedThreads``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4544
msgid ""
"Fixed issue with users re-following a previously unfollowed thread when "
"other users replied to the thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4545
msgid ""
"Clicking code blocks and in-line code no longer open the associated "
"thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4546
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where two scrollbars appeared in the Threads view on high "
"resolution monitors using zoom."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4547
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the quick channel switcher mention counts did not "
"follow collapsed threads logic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4548
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where threads started by webhooks/integrations were being "
"auto-followed by the webhook/integration creator when collapsed threads "
"was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4549
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where re-connecting to the websocket caused thread "
"mentions to be cleared in the user interface with collapsed reply threads"
" enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4550
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **New messages** line and date separators "
"overlapped text in a thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4553
msgid "v5.39 is built with Go ``1.16.7``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4555
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4714
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4901
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5085
msgid "Upcoming Deprecations in Mattermost v6.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4557
msgid ""
"The following deprecations are planned for the Mattermost v6.0 release, "
"which is scheduled for 2021/10/13. This list is subject to change prior "
"to the release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4559
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4718
msgid ""
"[Legacy Command Line Tools](https://docs.mattermost.com/manage/command-"
"line-tools.html). All commands have been fully replaced by "
"[mmctl](https://docs.mattermost.com/manage/mmctl-command-line-tool.html) "
"and new commands have been added over the last few months, making this "
"tool a full and robust replacement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4561
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4720
msgid ""
"[Slack Import via the web app](https://docs.mattermost.com/onboard"
"/migrating-to-mattermost.html#migrating-from-slack-using-the-mattermost-"
"web-app). The Slack import tool accessible via the Team Setting menu is "
"being replaced by the [mmetl](https://docs.mattermost.com/onboard"
"/migrating-to-mattermost.html#migrating-from-slack-using-the-mattermost-"
"mmetl-tool-and-bulk-import) tool that is much more comprehensive for the "
"types of data it can assist in uploading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4563
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4722
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4909
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5093
msgid ""
"MySQL versions below 5.7.7. Minimum support will now be for 5.7.12. This "
"version introduced a native JSON data type that lets us improve "
"performance and scalability of several database fields (most notably "
"Users and Posts props). Additionally, version 5.6 (our current minimum "
"version) reached [EOL in February 2021](https://www.mysql.com/support"
"/eol-notice.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4565
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4724
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4911
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5095
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch 5 and 6 - [versions 5.x reached EOL in March of 2019, and "
"versions 6.x reached EOL in November "
"2020](https://www.elastic.co/support/eol). Our minimal supported version "
"with Mattermost v6.0 will be Elasticsearch version 7.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4567
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4726
msgid ""
"Windows 7 reached [EOL in January 2020](https://support.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/what-does-it-mean-if-windows-isn-t-supported-"
"08f3b92d-7539-671e-1452-2e71cdad18b5). We will no longer provide support "
"for Mattermost Desktop App issues on Windows 7."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4571
msgid ""
"[ExperimentalTimezone](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure"
"/configuration-settings.html#timezone) configuration setting. The config "
"setting will be removed and the feature will be promoted to general "
"availability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4573
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4732
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4919
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5103
msgid ""
"All legacy channel sidebar experimental configuration settings. We "
"encourage customers using these settings to upgrade to v5.32 or later to "
"access [custom, collapsible channel "
"categories](https://mattermost.com/blog/custom-collapsible-channel-"
"categories/) among many other channel organization features. The settings"
" being deprecated include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4576
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4735
msgid ""
"[ExperimentalTownSquareIsReadOnly](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure"
"/configuration-settings.html#town-square-is-read-only-experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4591
msgid ""
"Pinned posts are no longer highlighted "
"[MM-34870](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-34870)."
msgstr ""

