msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4611
msgid "**v5.38.2, released 2021-08-26**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4612
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4802
msgid "Upgraded Go version to 1.16.7 to fix an application crash issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4613
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where mmctl ``config reload`` command was missing local-"
"mode server-side implementation. "
"[MM-38082](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-38082)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4614
msgid "**v5.38.1, released 2021-08-18**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4615
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Playbooks v1.16.0 could not be installed as a pre-"
"packaged plugin "
"[MM-37928](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-37928)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4616
msgid "**v5.38.0, released 2021-08-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4617
msgid "Original 5.38.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4619
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.38.0 contains low to medium level security fixes. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) to "
"this release is recommended. Details will be posted on our [security "
"updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after "
"release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4622
msgid ""
"The “config watcher” (the mechanism that automatically reloads the "
"``config.json`` file) has been removed in favor of the ``mmctl config "
"reload`` command, which must be run to apply configuration changes after "
"they are made on disk. This change improves configuration performance and"
" robustness."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4625
msgid ""
"v5.38 adds fixes for some of the incorrect mention counts and unreads "
"around threads and channels since the introduction of Collapsed Reply "
"Threads (Beta). This fix is done through a SQL migration, and it may take"
" several minutes to complete for large databases. The "
"``fixCRTChannelMembershipCounts`` fix takes 1 minute and 20 seconds for a"
" database containing approximately 4 million channel memberships and "
"about 130,000 channels. The ``fixCRTThreadCountsAndUnreads`` fix takes "
"about 3 minutes and 30 seconds for a database containing 56367 threads, "
"124587 thread memberships, and 220801 channel memberships. These are on "
"MySQL v5.6.51."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4626
msgid ""
"Focalboard v0.8.2 (released with Mattermost v5.38.0) requires Mattermost "
"v5.37+ due to the new database connection system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4629
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v5.37, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4634
msgid "Granular Data Retention Policies (Enterprise E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4635
msgid ""
"A ``data_retention`` type job can now be run even if the global policy is"
" disabled. The granular (i.e. team and channel-specific) policies will be"
" executed when the data retention job is run. Please note there is a "
"known issue where deleted posts get displayed in channels without new "
"activity after the retention job is run.  This issue is tracked with "
"[this ticket](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-36574)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4637
msgid "Enhanced User Onboarding Experience"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4638
msgid ""
"To help new users get started with Mattermost, new Getting Started steps "
"have been added to the onboarding experience. These steps help users to "
"complete their profile, name their teams, configure desktop "
"notifications, and invite others to join their team. Additionally, once "
"the onboarding is complete, users are provided with helpful tips to get "
"started with channels, plugins, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4641
msgid ""
"``Incident Collaboration`` was rebranded to ``Playbooks``. Also the "
"channel right-hand sidebar is redesigned, our own playbooks are shared as"
" templates, and more triggers and actions were added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4643
msgid "Focalboard Updates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4644
msgid ""
"Added created-by property and improved performance with shared database "
"connections. Focalboard 0.8.2 requires Mattermost v5.37+ due to a new "
"database connection system."
msgstr ""

