msgid "Collapsed Reply Threads (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4831
msgid ""
"We're excited to give you early access to Collapsed Reply Threads (Beta)."
" It can be enabled in the **System Console > Experimental > Collapsed "
"Reply Threads (Beta)**. Learn more about the features and known issues in"
" [our documentation](https://docs.mattermost.com/help/messaging"
"/organizing-conversations.html)."
msgstr ""

