"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) to "
"this release is recommended. Details will be posted on our [security "
"updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after "
"release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-"
"report/?redirect_source=mm-org)."
msgstr ""

