"Added performance improvements by reducing the time taken to re-render "
"when a post is received."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4961
msgid "**v5.36.0, released 2021-06-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4962
msgid "Original 5.36.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4964
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.36.0 contains a high level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) to "
"this release is recommended. Details will be posted on our [security "
"updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after "
"release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-"
"report/?redirect_source=mm-org)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4967
msgid ""
"Gossip clustering mode is now in General Availability and is no longer "
"available as an option. All cluster traffic will always use the gossip "
"protocol. The config setting ``UseExperimentalGossip`` has no effect and "
"has only been kept for compatibility purposes. The setting to use gossip "
"has been removed from the System Console. **Note:** For High Availability"
" upgrades, all nodes in the cluster must use a single protocol. If an "
"existing system is not currently using gossip, one node in a cluster "
"can't be upgraded while other nodes in the cluster use an older version. "
"Customers must either use gossip for their High Availability upgrade, or "
"customers must shut down all nodes, perform the upgrade, and then bring "
"all nodes back up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4970
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v5.35, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4975
msgid "Focalboard (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4976
msgid ""
"Focalboard is now integrated with Mattermost as a beta feature in v5.36. "
"To enable Focalboard, open the Marketplace from the sidebar menu, install"
" the Focalboard plugin, then click on **Configure**, enable it, and save."
" Update your NGINX or Apache web proxy config."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4978
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5191
msgid "Incident Collaboration (Enterprise Edition E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4979
