"Includes automated welcome message, team-wide playbook access, and "
"permission control for playbook creation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4981
msgid "Hungarian Language Support (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4982
msgid "Mattermost is now available in Hungarian."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4987
msgid ""
"If message autoresponder is set, only one message is now sent to a given "
"user irrespective of how many Direct Message messages the user receives."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4988
msgid ""
"Added status icons on **Add members** to channel and **Add members** to "
"team lists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4989
msgid ""
"Added a keyboard shortcut to focus on the Search bar and search in the "
"current channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4990
msgid "A search tip is now shown when scrolling back in a channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4991
msgid "Improved the error text in the **Edit Channel Header** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4992
msgid ""
"Added the ability to clear a custom status when only an emoji and no text"
" is set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4993
msgid "Redesigned message notification emails."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4994
msgid ""
"When **Show online availability on profile images** is set to **Off**, "
"the online status icon is hidden from the profile image in the center "
"channel and the right-hand side view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4997
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5399
msgid ""
"Added a performance improvement to the emoji picker overlay to improve "
"typing performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:4998
msgid "Added performance improvements when receiving new posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5001
msgid ""
"``TCP_NO_DELAY`` is disabled for Websocket connections to allow for "
"higher throughput."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5002
msgid "Compliance Monitoring CSV files are no longer limited to 30,000 rows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5003
msgid ""
"The default value of the [Support "
"Email](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/config-settings.html"
"#support-email) (previously ``_feedback@mattermost.com_``) has been "
"removed. Admin Advisor will now prompt System Admins about missing "
"configuration for the [Support "
"Email](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/config-settings.html"
"#support-email). This value is required, and it ensures Mattermost "
"account requests are sent to the correct team for resolution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5004
msgid ""
"The **Marketplace** button in the **Main Menu** is now displayed if the "
"user has the ``sysconsole_write_plugins`` permission."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5005
msgid ""
"Added new feature discoveries in the System Console, including Data "
"Retention Policy and OpenID Connect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5006
msgid "Added basic intra-cluster communication support for plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5007
msgid "Improved error messages for ``/header`` and ``/purpose`` commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5008
msgid ""
"Team-restricted direct channel creation is now also applied to the "
"backend. Previously, this was restricted to the frontend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5009
msgid ""
"Refactored the config storing logic to improve its robustness and "
"performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5010
msgid ""
"Added a visual grouping of related settings under AD/LDAP in the System "
"Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5013
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where bulk export generated invalid Direct Message "
"channels between deactivated users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5014
msgid "Fixed an issue where the custom status cleared slash commands on mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5015
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with an incorrect error message when trying to change "
"handle via API to another one that already existed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5016
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where LDAP Group Sync didn't work when using SAML (ADFS) "
"for authentication and AD/LDAP Group Sync unless "
"``EnableSyncWithLdapIncludeAuth`` was set to ``true``, which caused the "
"``AuthData`` to be stored in AD/LDAP format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5017
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a user with 'No Access' permission could still "
"access **Groups**, **Channels** and **Teams** configuration pages through"
" a URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5018
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where **Remove from channel** and **Remove Team Member** "
"menu items were visible in a group-synced channel or team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5019
msgid "Fixed various bugs related to hardcoded theme colours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5020
msgid ""
"Fixed UI issues related to hardcoded variables and misalignment of the "
"channel header with the **Has guests** text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5021
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with SAML Sign-on where System Admins were unable to "
"modify **Service Provider Login URL** unless ``VerifySignature`` was "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5022
msgid ""
"Fixed a race condition where enabling plugins would result in spurious "
"errors in the logs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5023
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug where team member permissions were not updated after "
"associating a team with a permission scheme."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5024
msgid ""
"Fixed the responses of the role by ID and all roles of API endpoints when"
" the role was associated to channel schemes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5025
msgid "Removed sticky sidebar headings in favor of fixing nesting errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5026
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Close** button in the **Create New Category** "
"modal was only visible on mouse hover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5027
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug where session expiration was extended with activity "
"regardless of what the config setting "
"``ServiceSettings.ExtendSessionLengthWithActivity`` was set to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5028
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the ``idmigrate`` command did not update values if "
"they were not already present as LDAP attributes in the ``config.json``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5029
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the job scheduler server could miss a \"changed "
"leader\" cluster event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5030
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where using ``Ctrl+Cmd+F`` on the MacOS Desktop App opened"
" the search instead of full-screened the app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5031
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the message input box was shadowed when uploading a "
"file in the center channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5032
msgid ""
"Fixed an error caused by a post created with a non-string attachment "
"field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5033
msgid ""
"Fixed the opacity of the read state in the channel sidebar, as well as "
"enhanced the opacity of the channel icon when the channel was unread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5034
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where users were unable to sign in with O365 "
"authentication when the AuthData was formatted differently between "
"Office365 OAuth and Office 365 OpenID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5035
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where custom emojis for custom statuses were not loaded on"
" page refresh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5036
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the “Set a status” placeholder in the profile "
"popover was not correctly themed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5037
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where bots showed the integration owner's custom status in"
" the post header in the right-hand side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5043
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7752
msgid "Under ``ComplianceSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5044
msgid ""
"Added a new config setting ``BatchSize``. Compliance Monitoring CSV files"
" are no longer limited to 30,000 rows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5045
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6321
msgid "Under ``SupportSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5046
msgid ""
"``SupportEmail`` default value is now empty instead of "
"``_feedback@mattermost.com_``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5048
msgid ""
"A new setting ``EnableColor`` was added to ``LogSettings`` and "
"``NotificationLogSettings``. Non-JSON console logs will now be colored if"
" that field is set to ``true``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5050
msgid ""
