#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5669
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where subsequent migrations failed to run after running a "
"dot release on new installations. "
"[MM-35931](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-35931)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5147
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the server would crash if content extractor "
"dependencies for PDFs were not present. "
"[MM-35990](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-35990)"
