"[MM-35861](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-35861)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5150
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with extracting OpenDocument Text files as part of content"
