msgid ""
"Release v5.33 - [Feature "
"Release](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/release-"
"definitions.html#feature-release)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5395
msgid "**v5.33.5, released 2021-06-11**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5396
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.33.5 contains a high level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5397
msgid "**v5.33.4, released 2021-06-03**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5400
msgid "**v5.33.3, released 2021-03-31**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5401
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where, after migrating to OpenID, Office 365 returned "
"different ID attributes based on user type, causing an error for users "
"with expired sessions when they tried to sign in to Mattermost. "
"[MM-34356](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-34356)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5402
msgid "**v5.33.2, released 2021-03-25**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5403
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5679
msgid ""
"Improved typing performance on busy servers with lots of active users and"
" with the new sidebar enabled. "
"[MM-30407](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-30407)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5404
msgid ""
"Reverted the WebSocket improvement added in v5.33.0 where epoll was used "
"to manually read from a WebSocket connection. It was reverted because "
"unofficial Mattermost builds in several different platforms broke due to "
"the WebSocket changes. "
"[MM-34158](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-34158)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5405
msgid "**v5.33.1, released 2021-03-22**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5406
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where WebSockets failed with TLS connections. "
"[MM-34000](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-34000)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5407
msgid ""
"Fixed a race condition which would crash the app server due to improper "
"handling of WebSocket closing. "
"[MM-33233](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-33233)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5408
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the ``mmctl config`` command  didn't recognize newer"
" settings (e.g. ``ClusterSettings.EnableGossipCompression``)  that were "
"introduced in v5.33.0. "
"[MM-34046](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-34046)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5409
msgid "**v5.33.0, released 2021-03-17**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5410
msgid "Original 5.33.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5412
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.33.0 contains low-level security fixes. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) to "
"this release is recommended. Details will be posted on our [security "
"updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after "
"release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-"
"report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5415
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5454
msgid ""
"Deleting a reaction is now a soft delete in the ``Reactions`` table. A "
"schema update is required and may take up to 15 seconds on first run with"
" large data sets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5416
msgid ""
"WebSocket handshakes done with an HTTP version lower than 1.1 will result"
" in a warning, and the server will transparently upgrade the version to "
"1.1 to comply with the WebSocket RFC. This is done to work around "
"incorrect Nginx (and other proxy) configs that do not set the "
"``proxy_http_version`` directive to 1.1. This facility will be removed in"
" a future Mattermost version. It is strongly recommended to fix the proxy"
" configuration to correctly use the WebSocket protocol."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5419
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v5.32, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5424
msgid "OpenID Connect for OAuth 2.0 Authentication (E20 Edition)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5425
msgid ""
"OpenID Connect enables authentication to Mattermost using any OAuth 2.0 "
"provider that adheres to the OpenID Connect specification. This feature "
"is available for Mobile Apps in the v1.40 release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5427
msgid "Support Packet Generation (E10 & E20 Editions)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5428
msgid ""
"Mattermost provides the ability to download configuration details, logs, "
"and other deployment information when requesting commercial support for "
"Mattermost self-managed E10 or E20 Enterprise editions, or Mattermost "
"Cloud editions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5430
msgid "Updated Incident Collaboration Plugin to 1.4.0 (E20 Edition)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5431
msgid ""
"Added an Incident Timeline to support status updates and other key events"
" shown chronologically in the right-hand sidebar. The timeline enables "
"users to easily gather information for post-incident reports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5433
msgid "Custom Statuses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5434
msgid ""
"Users now gain the flexibility to express their current status in any way"
" they prefer. Set a custom status to add a descriptive status message and"
" emoji that’s visible to everyone throughout the app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5439
msgid "Improved the **Add Members** to channel modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5440
msgid "Added **Formatting** shortcut keys to the **Shortcut** modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5441
msgid ""
"Added localization to the date picker used when searching for posts "
"around a given date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5442
msgid ""
"The autocomplete popover is now positioned relative to the @, ~, or / "
"trigger in the post draft."
