#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5443
msgid "Removed the 5-page limit on previewing PDFs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5444
msgid "Added ``files`` as a reserved team name."
