msgid ""
"During the user import process, a change in a user's ``NotifyProps`` will"
" not send an email notification. This is done to make it consistent with "
"other parts of the import process where a change in user's attributes "
"would also not send any notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5461
msgid "Implemented a job to delete unused export files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5464
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Database Schema upgrade step for v5.29.1 was not"
" taken into account in releases v5.30 and later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5465
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where ``mmctl channel move`` did not allow moving private "
"channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5466
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where ``mmctl config set PluginSettings.EnableUploads`` to"
" change a configuration value did not return an error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5467
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the instructions to search for users in **System "
"Console > Reporting > Server Logs** were not up-to-date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5468
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where no error message was displayed when adding an LDAP "
"Group Synchronized Team in **System Console > User Management > Users**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5469
msgid "Fixed an issue where markdown tables did not wrap correctly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5470
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the search bar styling on dark themes was incorrect "
"on mobile web view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5471
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Main Menu** on webapp appeared more left-"
"aligned than previous releases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5472
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where sticky sidebar headings appeared under **More "
"Unreads**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5473
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the group channel icon was misaligned in the channel"
" switcher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5474
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where line breaks were ignored when used with inline "
"images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5475
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the channel switcher did not focus on the first list"
" result after a backspace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5476
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where demoting a user to a guest would not take effect in "
"an environment with read replicas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5477
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug with in-product notices where a date constraint might fail to"
" match, which would lead to the notice not being fetched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5478
msgid "Fixed an issue where creation of a bot would fail due to replica lag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5479
msgid ""
"The ``DownloadComplianceReport`` function in the Golang driver has been "
"fixed to download a full report as a zip archive."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5480
msgid ""
"Fixed Cache-Control headers to instruct that responses may only be cached"
" on browsers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5481
msgid ""
"Fixed a panic when the OAuth discovery endpoint would not return a Cache-"
"Control header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5488
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableGossipCompression``, to disable compression in the Gossip "
"protocol. By default the value of the setting is ``true``. This is done "
"to maintain compatibility with old servers in a cluster. Once all servers"
" in a cluster are upgraded, it is recommended to disable this setting for"
" better performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5490
msgid ""
"Added ``ConnMaxIdleTimeMilliseconds``, to allow System Admins to control "
"the maximum time a database connection can remain idle. The default value"
" is set to 5 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5492
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableCustomUserStatuses``, to allow users to set descriptive "
"status messages and optional status emoji that are visible to all users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5495
msgid "v5.33 is built with Go ``1.15.5``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5498
msgid ""
"Added ``types/react-overlays``, ``crypto-browserify``, ``process`` and "
"``stream-browserify``, and removed ``node-semver`` from "
"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5499
msgid ""
"Removed ``isomorphic-fetch`` from https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-redux."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5502
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Added a new ``GET /{team_id}/threads/{thread_id}`` API method for "
"retrieving single threads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5503
msgid "Added a new ``/exports`` API endpoint to generate and manage export files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5504
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Added a new ``/users/{user_id}/teams/{team_id}/threads/mention_counts`` "
"API endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5505
msgid "Added a new ``GET /api/v4/cloud/subscription/stats`` API endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5506
msgid ""
"Added a new ``GET /api/v4/cloud/subscription/limitreached/invite`` API "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5507
msgid ""
"Added new ``PUT /api/v4/users/<id>/status/custom``, ``DELETE "
"/api/v4/users/<id>/status/custom``, and ``DELETE "
"/api/v4/users/<id>/status/custom/recent`` API endpoints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5508
msgid ""
"The ``/api/v4/users/me/auth`` API endpoint can no longer be used to "
"change passwords. This was a hidden feature that was not documented, but "
"was nevertheless possible. We have removed this hidden feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5509
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Updated ``/users/{user_id}/teams/{team_id}/threads`` API to support the "
"``unread=true`` query parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5510
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The ``/api/v4/users/{user_id}/teams/{team_id}/threads`` API endpoint now "
"accepts \"before\" and \"after\" parameters instead of a page index."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5511
msgid ""
"Removed the session required restriction from the ``GET "
"api/v4/subscription/stats`` API endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5514
msgid ""
"Improved the WebSocket implementation by using epoll to manually read "
"from a WebSocket connection. As a result, the number of goroutines is "
"expected to go down by half. This implementation is only available on "
"Linux and FreeBSD-based distributions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5515
msgid ""
"The ``UserUpdate`` WebSocket Event is now broadcast by two more APIs, "
"``plugin.UpdateUser`` and ``ConvertBotToUser``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5518
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5638
msgid ""
"Config.json can reset when running the command ``systemctl restart "
"mattermost``, and when running any commands that write to the config "
"(e.g. ``config`` or ``plugin``) "
"[MM-33752](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-33752), "
"[MM-32390](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-32390)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5520
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5641
msgid ""
"Adding an at-mention at the start of a post draft, then pressing the left"
" or right arrow can clear the post draft and the undo history "
"[MM-33823](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-33823)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5521
msgid ""
"In some cases, the **New messages** toast appears without replacing "
"variables with text. "
"[MM-33829](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-33829)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5525
msgid ""
"Slack theme import fails due to changes in formatting of Slack export "
"color schemes "
"[MM-30531](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-30531)."
msgstr ""

