msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5768
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL ended long-term support for [version 9.4 in February "
"2020](https://www.postgresql.org/support/versioning). From v5.26 "
"Mattermost officially supports PostgreSQL version 10 as PostgreSQL 9.4 is"
" no longer supported. New installs will require PostgreSQL 10+. Previous "
"Mattermost versions, including our current ESR, will continue to be "
"compatible with PostgreSQL 9.4. PostgreSQL 9.4 and all 9.x versions are "
"now fully deprecated in our v5.30 release (December 16, 2020). Please "
"follow the instructions under the Upgrading Section within [the "
"PostgreSQL "
"documentation](https://www.postgresql.org/support/versioning/)."
msgstr ""

