msgid "Configure New Admin Roles Permissions in the System Console (E20, Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5776
msgid ""
"Mattermost [recently released three new pre-built granular administrator "
"roles](https://mattermost.com/blog/mattermost-release-v5-28/) to enable "
"you to selectively delegate administrative tasks to other members of your"
" organization. The three new roles are System Manager, User Manager, and "
"Read-only Admin. Now you can configure specific permissions for these "
"roles directly from the System Console."
