msgid ""
"Release v5.29 - [Quality "
"Release](https://handbook.mattermost.com/operations/research-and-"
"development/product/release-process/release-overview)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5879
msgid "**v5.29.2, released 2021-01-18**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5880
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the ``UnreadMentions`` column was missing in the "
"``ThreadMemberships`` table for servers upgrading from v5.29.0. Admins "
"planning to enable [Collapsed Reply Threads](https://mattermost.com/blog"
"/dev-sneak-peek-collapsed-reply-threads/) (available in beta in Q1 2021) "
"are recommended to upgrade to v5.29.2 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5881
msgid "**v5.29.1, released 2020-12-03**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5882
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5975
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6130
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6387
msgid ""
"Disabled the xmlsec1-based SAML library in favor of the re-enabled and "
"improved SAML library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5883
msgid ""
"Added ``UnreadMentions`` column to ``ThreadMemberships`` table, and fixed"
" server log warnings related to ``ThreadMemberships``. Admins planning to"
" enable [Collapsed Reply Threads](https://mattermost.com/blog/dev-sneak-"
"peek-collapsed-reply-threads/) (available in beta in Q1 2021) are "
"recommended to upgrade to v5.29.1 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5884
msgid "**v5.29.0, released 2020-11-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5885
msgid "Original 5.29.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5888
msgid ""
"A new configuration setting ``ThreadAutoFollow`` has been added to "
"support [Collapsed Reply "
"Threads](https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1QSrPws3N8AMSjVyOKp15FKT7O0fGMSx8YidjSDS4Wng/edit#slide=id.g2f0aecc189_0_245)"
" releasing in beta in Q1 2021. This setting is enabled by default and may"
" affect server performance. It is recommended to review our "
"[documentation on hardware "
"requirements](https://docs.mattermost.com/install/requirements.html"
"#hardware-requirements) to ensure your servers are appropriately scaled "
"for the size of your user base."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5891
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v5.28, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5896
msgid "Channel Moderation Settings now generally available (E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5897
msgid ""
"[Channel moderation](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment/team-channel-"
"management.html#channels) feature was moved out of beta to general "
"availability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5899
msgid "Mattermost Omnibus now generally available"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5900
msgid ""
"[Mattermost Omnibus](https://docs.mattermost.com/help/getting-started"
"/light-install.html) feature was moved out of beta to general "
"availability."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5905
msgid ""
"Added a new browser favicon state for when there are new messages but no "
"mentions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5906
msgid ""
"Improved sort order of the channel switcher to prioritize recently viewed"
" channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5907
msgid ""
"Improved filter control for the new channel sidebar to show unread "
"channels without categories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5908
msgid ""
"The 'More unreads' banner in the new channel sidebar was updated to match"
" the new mobile app styling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5909
msgid ""
"A threshold was added from the bottom of the screen for the new messages "
"toast."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5912
msgid "Fixed an issue where Enterprise CLI commands would not run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5913
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the right-hand side comment box got pushed out of "
"the view when a new message was posted in the message thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5914
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the color picker colors were missing from the "
"Announcement Banner page in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5915
msgid "Fixed an issue where links in channels headers overlapped in some cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5916
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a plugin could create a blank ephymeral post, "
"leading to a white screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5917
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the channel switcher dialog was not accessible with "
"a screen reader."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5918
msgid "Fixed an issue where email addresses were not auto-detected on invites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5919
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where duplicate sidebar categories could be created on "
"first use of the new experimental sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5920
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where installing plugins on a server using "
"``FileSettings.PathPrefix`` caused issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5921
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the error message was unclear when a plugin crashed "
"during a slash command execution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5922
msgid "Fixed an issue where bot icon images had too much height."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5923
msgid "Fixed an issue where tags where nested in Plugin Marketplace labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5924
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with inconsistent behaviour in channel mentions in message"
" attachments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5925
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where ephemeral posts posted by bot accounts showed a "
"wrong username on the right-hand side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5926
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the category headings in the experimental sidebar "
"were not sticky and overlapped the More Unreads indicators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5927
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Automatic Direct Message Replies were not shown on "
"the right-hand side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5928
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Automatic Direct Message Replies were still showing "
"after the root post was deleted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:5931
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6073
