#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:14487
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:14880
msgid "Search"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6019
msgid "Added wildcard support to Bleve."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6020
msgid ""
"Search terms including stopwords now return matching stopwords instead of"
" an empty result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6021
msgid ""
"Removed duplication in ``is_or_search`` and ``IncludeDeletedChannels`` "
"parameters for search."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6022
msgid "``*`` characters are now filtered from the search terms in the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6023
msgid ""
"Fixed inconsistencies across product when using ``in:@` / `in:``, such as"
" displaying Direct and Group Messages in ``in:@`` search suggestions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6026
msgid ""
"Added an option in the **Account Settings** to select different desktop "
"notification sounds. This setting is available in supported browsers and "
"in the Desktop app v4.6 and later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6029
msgid ""
"Added ``config migrate``, ``config subpath``, ``user delete``, "
"``integrity``, ``user migrate_auth``, ``moveChannel``, "
"``updateChannelPrivacy``, ``restoreTeam``, ``channel delete``, and plugin"
" marketplace commands to mmctl."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6032
msgid "Plugins now start concurrently on server startup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6033
msgid "Plugin tooltips are now only rendered when user hovers over a link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6034
msgid ""
"Added a ``CreateCommand`` plugin API that creates a slash command that is"
" not handled by the plugin itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6037
msgid ""
"Added the ability to upload and remove private and public certificates "
"for LDAP authentication."
