"themselves, followed by period, underscore, or hyphen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6301
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a 500 error was returned by the ``/posts/unread`` "
"endpoint caused by an [integer "
"overflow](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Integer_overflow) when "
"``limit_after`` was set to 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6302
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the footer text in invitation emails was not "
"translated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6303
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where ``PermanentDeleteTeam`` did not return an error but "
"did a soft deletion if ``EnableAPITeamDeletion`` was not set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6304
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on PostgreSQL where logging in using MFA did not respect "
"the uppercase of the email address."
msgstr ""

