#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6669
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.23.0 contains a low level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6672
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL ended long-term support for [version 9.4 in February "
"2020](https://www.postgresql.org/support/versioning). Mattermost will "
"officially be supporting PostgreSQL version 10 with the Mattermost v5.26 "
"release as PostgreSQL 9.4 is no longer supported. New installs will "
"require PostgreSQL version 10. Previous Mattermost versions, including "
"our current ESR, will continue to be compatible with PostgreSQL version "
"9.4. In our 6.0 release (date to be announced), we plan on fully "
"deprecating PostgreSQL 9.4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6674
msgid ""
"We highly recommend upgrading to PostgreSQL version 10+. Please follow "
"the instructions under the Upgrading Section within [the PostgreSQL "
"documentation](https://www.postgresql.org/support/versioning/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6677
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where using slash command ``/leave`` failed to leave the "
"channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6678
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where clicking on a channel link from a Direct Message "
"channel that linked to a different team resulted in a \"Page not Found\" "
"error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6679
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where reloading a channel caused the channel to be shown "
"as read-only for a few seconds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6680
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Channel Export plugin bot channel did not appear"
" on the left-hand side channel sidebar until the user switched to a "
"different channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6681
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where no channel suggestions were displayed for ``in:`` "
"search modifier for Guest Accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6682
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where ``Guest`` tags were not shown in Group Message "
"channel header."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6683
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where guest permissions could not be set in Team Override "
"Schemes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6684
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a \"this user didn't get notified\" system message "
"was missing if an at-mention was followed by a period and the user was "
"not in the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6685
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where batched emails were still sent even if there was "
"activity from the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6686
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where ``/me`` messages weren't formatted in the right-hand"
" side."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6687
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where mentions in header-changed system messages weren't "
"highlighted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6688
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a thread title was missing when initial message in a"
" thread showed as \"message deleted\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6689
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where there was no hover effect when mousing over options "
"in Search."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6690
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on Firefox where using Alt+arrow stopped working on read-"
"only channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6691
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where muted channels on another team appeared as unread in"
" team sidebar and browser tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6692
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the URL field on Rename Channel modal allowed more "
"than two underscores."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6693
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where pasting text from a GitHub code block erased post "
"textbox contents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6694
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where keyboard shortcuts to move between teams conflicted "
"with a native Linux OS shortcut for switching virtual desktops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6695
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where incoming webhooks that contained certain sized "
"attachments resulted in an infinite loop, causing a memory leak."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6696
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with errors appearing in logs when sending a direct "
"message to your own account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6697
msgid "Fixed an issue with a \"Failed to get membership\" log spam for bot posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6700
msgid ""
"Added ``react-native-mmkv-storage`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6701
msgid ""
"Added ``redux-action-buffer`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6702
msgid "Added ``redux-reset`` in https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6703
msgid ""
"Added ``serialize-error`` in https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6706
msgid ""
"Added a new API endpoint ``GET /api/v4/users/known`` to get the list of "
"user IDs of users with any direct relationship with a user. That means "
"any user sharing any channel, including direct and group channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6707
msgid ""
"``GET /api/v4/teams/:team_id/channels`` no longer requires the "
"``list_team_channels`` permission."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6710
msgid "Added a new ``update_team_scheme`` Websocket Event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6713
msgid ""
"**Copy Theme Colors** button on custom theme Display Settings modal is "
"not themed correctly on Mattermost dark theme."
msgstr ""

