"/release-faq.html#release-overview)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6732
msgid "**v5.22.3, released 2020-05-11**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6733
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where channels were shown as read-only when [Channel "
"Moderation feature](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment/advanced-"
"permissions.html#channel-moderation-beta-e20) was used in High "
"Availability environments. "
"[MM-24987](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-24987)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6734
msgid "**v5.22.2, released 2020-05-05**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6735
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where message reply threads did not get correctly imported"
" via [bulk loading tool](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment/bulk-"
"loading.html). "
"[MM-24707](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-24707)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6736
msgid "**v5.22.1, released 2020-04-23**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6737
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Amazon S3 file storage with IAM credentials failed "
"due to a bug in the ``minio-go`` library. "
"[MM-24388](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-24388)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6738
msgid "**v5.22.0, released 2020-04-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6739
msgid "Original 5.22.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6741
msgid "**Release day: 2020-04-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6743
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.22.0 contains a low level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6747
msgid ""
"v5.9.0 as our Extended Support Release (ESR) is coming to the end of its "
"life cycle and upgrading to 5.19.0 ESR or a later version is highly "
"recommended. v5.19.0 will continue to be our current ESR until October "
"15, 2020. [Learn more in our forum post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t"
"/upcoming-extended-support-release-updates/8526)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6751
msgid ""
"Due to fixing performance issues related to emoji reactions, the "
"performance of the upgrade has been affected in that the schema upgrade "
"now takes more time in environments with lots of reactions in their "
"database. These environments are recommended to perform the schema "
"migration during low usage times and potentially in advance of the "
"upgrade. Since this migration happens before the Mattermost Server is "
"fully launched, non-High Availability installs will be unreachable during"
" this time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6752
msgid ""
"The Channel Moderation Settings feature is supported on mobile app "
"versions v1.30 and later. In earlier versions of the mobile app, users "
"who attempt to post or react to posts without proper permissions will see"
" an error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6753
msgid ""
"Direct access to the ``Props`` field in the ``model.Post`` structure has "
"been deprecated. The available ``GetProps()`` and ``SetProps()`` methods "
"should now be used. Also, direct copy of the ``model.Post`` structure "
"must be avoided in favor of the provided ``Clone()`` method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6756
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than 5.21, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6761
msgid "Read-only channels and channel moderation settings (E20) (Beta)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6762
msgid ""
"System admins can use new channel-specific permissions to create read-"
"only channels, restrict who can post in certain channels, and more. This "
"feature is in beta and ships with Enterprise Edition E20."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6764
msgid "Team switch shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6765
msgid ""
"Added new keyboard shortcuts that allow users to switch to the next or "
"previous team using ``Ctrl/⌘ + Alt + Up/Down`` and switch to a specific "
"team using ``Ctrl/⌘ + Alt + #``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6766
msgid "Also added the ability to reorder teams on the sidebar via drag-and-drop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6768
msgid "Unarchive Channel option in the archived channels menu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6769
msgid ""
"Added the ability for users to restore archived channels via the "
"Mattermost interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6771
msgid "Channel sidebar reorganization features (Experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6772
msgid ""
"Added improvements to the channel sidebar, including the ability to "
"collapse categories in the sidebar (e.g., favorites, public channels, "
"private channels, and direct messages) to reduce unnecessary scrolling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6777
msgid ""
"Added several UI improvements, such as added a \"Close Group Message\" "
"option to Group Message menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6778
msgid "Added a keyboard shortcut to open/close the right-hand sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6779
msgid ""
"Added a keyboard shortcut to add reactions to last message in a channel "
"or a thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6780
msgid "Added infinite scroll to Select Teams screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6781
msgid "Updated the message permalink view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6784
msgid "Promoted Dutch and Russian languages to Beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6787
msgid "Added support for notification sounds in Firefox."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6790
msgid "Allow searching for files through the plugin API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6791
msgid "Allowed prepackaged and local plugins to set ``ReleaseNotesURL``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6794
msgid ""
"In interactive dialogs, the autocomplete lists now render below the input"
" field by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6795
msgid ""
"Extended the payload of slash commands to include a map of the users and "
"channels mentioned in the message to their corresponding identifiers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6796
msgid ""
"Added support for recognizing multi-line slash commands without requiring"
" trailing space after the trigger word."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6798
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6981
msgid "Bulk Import"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6799
msgid "Added support for exporting and importing the props of a post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6802
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a user's role was not reflected correctly in the "
"Channel Members Modal when it was updated after the modal was opened."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6803
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where verification emails were still sent on servers with "
"SMTP configured when`Enable Email Notifications` and `Require Email "
"Verification` were disabled in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6804
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a user account was still created when inviting a new"
" user to a team with an email address that didn't match the team's "
"allowed domain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6805
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where System Admins could not access the Teams menu of the"
" System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6806
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where an incorrect time was displayed at midnight when "
"24-hour clock display was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6807
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a channel appeared twice on the channel sidebar if "
"the channels were created with a certain arrangement of characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6808
msgid "Fixed an issue where pasting a custom theme caused a white screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6809
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a modified Edit Post dialog silently closed on a "
"mouse click outside it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6810
msgid "Fixed an issue where users were unable to drag and drop files on Edge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6811
msgid "Fixed an issue where the autoresponder responded to every bot post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6812
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Mattermost was unable to start if a configured mail "
"server was listening but not responding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6813
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where LDAP sync did not finish if read database replica "
"was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6814
msgid "Fixed a SIGSEGV crash issue when exporting to CSV."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6815
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Elasticsearch error was output when running "
"unrelated commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6816
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where importing from slack crashed due to invalid memory "
"access or nil pointer dereference."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6823
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableOpenTracing``, to enable a Jaeger client to be instantiated"
" and used to trace each HTTP request as it goes through App and Store "
"layers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6824
msgid "Added ``IdleTimeout``, to set an explicit idle timeout in the HTTP server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6825
msgid ""
"Added ``ExperimentalChannelSidebarOrganization``, to enable accessing the"
" experimental channel sidebar feature set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6826
msgid "Under ``NotificationLogSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6827
msgid ""
"Added ``SMTPServerTimeout``, to enable the maximum amount of time (in "
"seconds) allowed for establishing a TCP connection between Mattermost and"
" the SMTP server, to be idle before being terminated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6828
msgid ""
"Added ``DirectoryId`` object, to enable the ID of the application's AAD "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6829
msgid ""
"Added ``ExperimentalAuditSettings`` object, to enable the audit settings "
"to output audit records to syslog (local or remote server via TLS) and/or"
" to a local file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6832
msgid "Added ``core-js`` in https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-redux."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6833
msgid ""
"Added ``@types/redux-mock-store`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6834
msgid ""
"Added ``react-beautiful-dnd`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6835
msgid ""
"Added ``react-native-hw-keyboard-event`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6836
msgid ""
"Added ``react-native-v8`` in https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6837
msgid ""
"Removed ``jsc-android`` from https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"mobile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6840
msgid "Various indexes were added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6843
msgid ""
"Added ``GET api/v4/channels/:channels/moderations`` and ``PUT "
"api/v4/channels/:channels/moderations/patch`` to support channel "
"moderation settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6844
msgid ""
"Added a ``PUT api/v4/commands/move`` endpoint to move a command to "
"another team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6845
msgid "Added a ``GET api/v4/commands`` endpoint to retrieve a command by id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6848
msgid "Added ``channel_scheme_updated`` Websocket Event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6851
msgid ""
"Batched emails are still sent even if any activity from the user is "
"detected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6852
msgid ""
"Keyboard shortcut to move between teams conflicts with Linux native OS "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6853
msgid ""
"Webapp crashes if the Direct Message modal is open when a guest is "
"removed from a channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6854
msgid ""
"Slash command ``/leave`` fails to leave channel on webapp and crashes the"
" Android app."
msgstr ""

