#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6871
msgid ""
"Release v5.21 - [Quality Release](https://docs.mattermost.com/process"
"/release-faq.html#release-overview)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6873
msgid "**Release day: 2020-03-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6875
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.21.0 contains low level security fixes. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6878
msgid ""
"Honour key value expiry in KVCompareAndSet, KVCompareAndDelete and "
"KVList. We also improved handling of plugin key value race conditions and"
" deleted keys in Postgres."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6881
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where switching to an unread channel sometimes got stuck "
"at \"Loading...\" on certain screen resolutions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6882
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where bots could not be added to group-synced channels or "
"teams."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6883
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a user's authentication method in the System Console"
" was shown as email if it was actually LDAP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6884
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where lines in over 65536 characters caused bulk import to"
" fail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6885
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where code block line numbers were copied when pasting "
"into certain applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6886
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the right-hand side reply thread scrolled down after"
" receiving a new message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6887
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the post menu opened up in the right-hand side made "
"the menu options float off page if the parent post was short with no "
"replies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6888
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where enabling and disabling the demo plugin generated a "
"\"connection is shutdown\" error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6889
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where deactivated users with whom a user had never "
"interacted in a private message before appeared in the New Direct Message"
" menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6890
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where clicking on an image in external image preview "
"opened the image within the desktop app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6891
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where users were unable to open email links using View in "
"Browsers option in incognito mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6892
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where **Invite Guests > Emails** containing upper case "
"letters were rejected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6893
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a new user got a \"No more channels to join\" "
"message while scrolling through the channel list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6894
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where clicking on \"Terms of Service\" and \"Privacy "
"Policy\" on account creation on the desktop app didn't do anything."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6895
msgid "Fixed an issue where gendered emojis were rendered with the wrong gender."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6896
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where large video file uploads failed on the right-hand "
"side without an appropriate error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6899
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7042
msgid ""
"Verification emails are still sent on servers with SMTP configured "
"when`Enable Email Notifications` and `Require Email Verification` are "
"disabled in the System Console."
msgstr ""

