#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6915
msgid ""
"Release v5.20 - [Feature Release](https://docs.mattermost.com/process"
"/release-faq.html#release-overview)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6917
msgid "**v5.20.2, released 2020-03-12**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6918
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Mattermost server crashed when running a compliance "
"export. [MM-23157](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-23157)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6919
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where switching to an unread channel got stuck at "
"\"Loading...\" in certain screen resolutions. "
"[MM-22698](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/browse/MM-22698)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6920
msgid "**v5.20.1, released 2020-02-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6921
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where upgrading to v5.20 failed on servers running with "
"``PluginSettings.Enable = false``, and ``LogSettings.EnableDiagnostics = "
"true``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6922
msgid "**v5.20.0, released 2020-02-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6923
msgid "Original 5.20.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6925
msgid ""
"Mattermost v5.20.0 contains a low level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6930
msgid ""
"Any [pre-packaged "
"plugin](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/plugins.html#pre-"
"packaged-plugins) that is not enabled in the ``config.json`` will no "
"longer install automatically, but can continue to be installed via the "
"[plugin "
"marketplace](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/plugins.html"
"#plugin-marketplace)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6931
msgid ""
"Boolean elements from interactive dialogs are no longer serialized as "
"strings. While we try to avoid breaking changes, this change was "
"necessary to allow both the web and mobile apps to work with the boolean "
"elements introduced with v5.16."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6934
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than 5.19, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6939
msgid "A Banner to Jump to the Most Recent Posts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6940
msgid ""
"Ability to jump to the most recent posts in a channel by clicking a "
"banner that automatically appears in busy channels with unread messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6942
msgid "Open Email Notifications in the Desktop or Mobile App"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6943
msgid ""
"Ability to open messages from email notifications in the Mattermost "
"desktop or mobile apps instead of being directed to open them in the "
"browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6945
msgid "Ship MMCTL with Mattermost"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6946
msgid ""
"Manage servers remotely with `mmctl`, a CLI tool that mimics the "
"Mattermost CLI tool and ships inside Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6948
msgid "Reworked pre-packaged plugins"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6949
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged plugins are now “pre-downloaded” plugins that are available "
"within the Plugin Marketplace, even if your server doesn’t have direct "
"access to the internet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6951
msgid "Plugin Marketplace Labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6952
msgid ""
"Plugins supported by Mattermost and community supported plugins will be "
"visible, making it easier to select an appropriate plugin based on your "
"organization’s security policies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6954
msgid "Role mapping from LDAP and SAML (E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6955
msgid ""
"Ability to assign and restrict users to roles within Mattermost from your"
" single sign-on (SSO) system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6957
msgid "Faster SAML install and configuration (E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6958
msgid ""
"Ability to use SAML without installing a separate binary and pull "
"configuration metadata directly from the Identity Provider using an "
"account-specific URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6963
msgid "Added support for mute option in Direct Message channel menus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6964
msgid "Added a red dot to browser favicon when there are unread mentions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6965
msgid "Added support for displaying a left-hand side bot icon in the webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6966
msgid ""
"User's own username with a suffix 'you' is now shown in the username "
"autocomplete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6967
msgid "Allowed user autocomplete to match on terms with spaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6968
msgid "Improved autocomplete highlighting when using mouse and keyboard together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6969
msgid "Added support for showing single image thumbnails in compact view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6970
msgid ""
"Contents of View Members and Manage Members modals now refresh when a "
"user's role has changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6971
msgid ""
"Filtering search by channel now also shows the channel name and not only "
"its ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6972
msgid ""
"Users now cannot type account input fields longer than the maximum length"
" for first name, last name and email fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6975
msgid ""
"Added a way to show that a plugin requires a certain Mattermost "
"configuration setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6976
msgid "Added support for plugins to add menu items to the Channel Menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6979
msgid "Added a CLI command ``webhook move`` for moving outgoing webhooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6982
msgid ""
"When bulk import finds an already existing post, it now deletes existing "
"files before importing new ones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6983
msgid "Bulk export now includes direct messages from a user to themselves."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6986
msgid "Added support for Elasticsearch v7."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6987
msgid ""
"Added ability to inform System Admins when a user who managed bot "
"accounts is deactivated, and enable them to take ownership of the bot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6988
msgid ""
"Added LDAP/Elasticsearch/SQL Trace to server logs to make it easier for "
"admins to diagnose problems."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6989
msgid "Added ``plugins`` to the list of words that a team URL cannot start with."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6990
msgid "Removed 26 character requirement from post action IDs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6993
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where guest account creation erroneously considered the "
"global list of whitelisted domains."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6994
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where inviting multiple users with valid and invalid "
"emails caused the invites for the valid users not to be sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6995
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where option to invite users by email was displayed even "
"if email invitations were disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6996
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the channel drop-down **Leave Channel** failed to "
"leave the channel on a server with a subpath."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6997
msgid "Fixed an issue where messages with 2-byte characters didn't get posted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6998
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where links for recent mentions and flagged posts were "
"doubled in smaller window widths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:6999
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where opening the right-hand sidebar placed focus in the "
"Search box instead of the Text box."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7000
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where **Customization > Site Name** help text didn't match"
" text field behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7001
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the option to mark posts as unread was unexpectedly "
"available when viewing archived channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7002
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where emoji reactions shifted down a few pixels after "
"clicking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7003
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where pasting code from GitHub resulted in broken markup "
"and loss of text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7004
msgid "Fixed an issue where importing theme colours from Slack gave an error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7005
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where navigating to a plugin configuration page in the "
"System Console for a deleted plugin returned a `Not Found` error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7006
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where scroll bar was missing on the welcome tutorial "
"screen in web mobile view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7013
msgid ""
"Added ``IdpMetadataUrl``, to add the URL where Mattermost sends a request"
" to obtain setup metadata from the provider."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7014
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableAdminAttribute`` and ``AdminAttribute``, to add the "
"attribute in the SAML Assertion for designating System Admins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7016
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableAdminFilter`` and ``AdminFilter``, to enter a filter to use"
" for designating the System Admin role to users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7018
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableRemoteMarketplace``, to have the server attempt to connect "
"to the configured Plugin Marketplace to show the latest plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7019
msgid ""
"Added ``AutomaticPrepackagedPlugins``, so that any pre-packaged plugins "
"enabled in the configuration will be installed or upgraded automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7022
msgid ""
"Added ``@formatjs/intl-pluralrules`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7023
msgid ""
"Added ``@formatjs/intl-relativetimeformat`` in "
"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7024
msgid ""
"Added ``custom-protocol-detection`` in https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7025
msgid ""
"Added ``react-inlinesvg`` in https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"webapp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7028
msgid "Added ``Bots.LastIconUpdate`` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7029
msgid "Added ``GroupTeams.SchemeAdmin`` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7030
msgid "Added ``GroupChannels.SchemeAdmin`` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7033
msgid ""
"Added ``PUT /config/patch`` REST API endpoint that uses patch semantics "
"to only update the fields of the config that are provided, while leaving "
"the other fields unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7034
msgid ""
"Added ``POST /server_busy``, ``GET /server_busy`` and ``DELETE "
"/server_busy`` REST API endpoints to add the ability to turn off non-"
"critical services when under load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7037
msgid "Added ``channel_restored`` Websocket Event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7040
msgid "Code block line numbers are copied when pasting into certain applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7041
msgid ""
"Deactivated users with whom you never interacted in a private message "
"before appear in New Direct Message menu."
msgstr ""

