msgid "Breaking changes since last release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7941
msgid ""
"If your plugin uses the ``DeleteEphemeralMessage`` plugin API, update it "
"to accept a ``postId string`` parameter. See "
"[documentation](https://developers.mattermost.com/extend/plugins/server/reference/#API.DeleteEphemeralPost)"
" to learn more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7942
msgid ""
"Image link and YouTube previews do not display unless **System Console > "
"Enable Link Previews** is enabled. Please ensure that your Mattermost "
"server is connected to the internet and has network access to the "
"websites from which previews are expected to appear. [Learn more "
"here](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/config-settings.html"
"#enable-link-previews)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7943
msgid ""
"``ExperimentalEnablePostMetadata`` setting was removed. Post metadata, "
"including post dimensions, is now stored in the database to correct "
"scroll position and eliminate scroll jumps as content loads in a channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7946
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than 5.11, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7951
msgid "Infinite Scroll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7952
msgid ""
"Read messages more easily. Older posts are loaded automatically as you "
"scroll up instead of having to click the \"Load more messages\" button at"
" the top of the screen. This feature is not supported on Internet "
"Explorer (IE11)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7955
msgid ""
"Users no longer have to rely on creating fake user accounts to act as "
"bots for integrations. Instead, create a real bot account and use it to "
"generate bot access tokens to interact with users and complete tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7956
msgid ""
"Users can can also use these bots to post to any channel in the system, "
"whether it’s a private team, private channel or a direct message channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7957
msgid ""
"For Enterprise deployments, bot accounts no longer count as an active "
"user towards licensing subscriptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7958
msgid ""
"To learn more about bot accounts, see [the "
"documentation](https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/reference/bot-"
"accounts/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7960
msgid "Jira Plugin 2.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7961
msgid ""
"Enhanced existing plugin for a deep two-way integration between Jira and "
"Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7962
msgid ""
"Send notifications for Jira issue creation, issue updates and comments to"
" Mattermost channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7963
msgid ""
"Users can also take quick actions in Mattermost, including creating Jira "
"issues, attaching Mattermost messages to Jira issues, and transitioning "
"issues via slash commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7964
msgid ""
"For a full feature set for 2.0, see https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-jira#jira-20-features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7967
msgid "New pre-packaged plugins bundled with this Mattermost release include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7968
msgid ""
"[GitHub plugin](https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-github) "
"for notifications, reminders and slash commands to stay up-to-date on "
"issues and pull requests. Supports GitHub SaaS and Enterprise versions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7969
msgid ""
"[Autolink plugin](https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"autolink) to automatically hyperlink text, such as adding links to your "
"issue tracker when someone posts an issue key or number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7970
msgid ""
"[Custom Attributes plugin](https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"plugin-custom-attributes) to add custom attributes in the user profile "
"popover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7971
msgid ""
"[Welcome Bot plugin](https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-"
"welcomebot) to improve onboarding and HR processes by adding a Welcome "
"Bot that helps add new team members to channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7972
msgid ""
"[Amazon SNS CloudWatch plugin](https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"plugin-aws-sns) to send alert notifications from [Amazon AWS "
"CloudWatch](https://aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/) to Mattermost channels "
"via AWS SNS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7974
msgid "System Console Reorganization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7975
msgid ""
"Informational architecture restructure of the System Console to make a "
"more logical flow to the settings and to provide a more cohesive "
"experience for hiding features on the Mattermost Private Cloud product, "
"where the system admin should not have access to change configurations "
"that affect the environment directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7977
msgid "Net Promoter Score (NPS)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7978
msgid ""
"We are gathering user feedback to help improve user experience and hear "
"directly from our users. The feature can be disabled via **System Console"
" > Plugins > Net Promoter Score**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7980
msgid "AD/LDAP Group Sync Removals (Enterprise Edition E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7981
msgid ""
"System Admins can manage the membership of private teams and channels "
"with AD/LDAP groups, eliminating the need to individually add and remove "
"members. Users in the groups are automatically removed from the team or "
"channel when removed from an associated group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7983
msgid ""
"User/Channel Search & Autocomplete in Elasticsearch (Enterprise Edition "
"E20)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7984
msgid ""
"Added new settings in **System Console > Elasticsearch** to enable "
"[Elasticsearch](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment/elasticsearch.html)"
" for autocompletion queries. When enabled, Elasticsearch uses its indexed"
" data for user/channel search queries and autocomplete queries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7989
msgid "Added an option to add a user to a channel from the profile popover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7990
msgid "Removed ``@`` for full name display in push notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7993
msgid "Added support for Markdown in plugin System Console help text fields."
