#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7994
msgid "Added support for plugins to override ephemeral posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:7997
msgid "Promoted Polish language to \"official\"."
msgstr ""

