"Added a ``mattermost user convert --bot`` CLI command to convert user "
"accounts to bot accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8002
msgid ""
"Implemented a new command ``config migrate`` for migrating configuration "
