#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8108
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If your integration uses ``Update.Props == nil`` to clear ``Props``, this"
" will no longer work in 5.11+. Instead, use ``Update.Props == {}`` to "
"clear properties. This change was made because ``Update.Props == nil`` "
"unintentionally cleared all ``Props``, such as the profile picture, "
"instead of preserving them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8111
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than 5.10, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/important-upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8115
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where plugin settings link didn't appear until refresh "
"after uploading a plugin in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8116
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where **System Console** > **Users** bottom section of "
"\"user actions\" menu was cut off for the last three users in the screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8117
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where corners on image previews were squared instead of "
"rounded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8118
msgid "Fixed an issue where the hover effect was missing on images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8119
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a post action (via button or menu) reset the profile"
" picture of the webhook post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8120
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where a flagged post containing only file attachments "
"didn't render in the sidebar until loaded in the centre."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8121
msgid "Fixed an issue where some strings in channel settings weren't localizable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8122
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where clicking \"Open\" downloaded an image instead of "
"opening it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8123
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where an at-mention user autocomplete overlapped with the "
"channel header when drafting a long message containing a file attachment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8124
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the reply bar showed gaps between posts in compact "
"view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8125
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where markdown preview of nested lists displayed "
"differently from styling in posted message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8126
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Safari suggested auto-corrections in the channel "
"switcher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8127
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on Safari where the mention badge count didn't update "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8128
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the post action menu overlapped with posts on "
"iOS/Safari on mobile view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8129
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where interactive dialog's description text colour was "
"difficult to see on dark themes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8130
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where delete permissions for custom emoji team admin role "
"were not always granted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8131
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with a slight scroll pop on reaching loading indictor of "
"search results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8132
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where adding a user to a channel that is in the unreads "
"section caused the channel to become read in the user's view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8133
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the channel menu dropdown icon had an unnecessary "
"tooltip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8134
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on LDAP Groups where adding a group to a team provided an "
"unnecessary permission confirmation modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8135
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue on mobile view where clicking on the attachment icon "
"didn't bring up the dropdown menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8138
msgid ""
"Buttons inside ephemeral posts are not clickable / functional on the "
"mobile app."
msgstr ""

