msgid "**v5.8.0, released 2019-02-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8404
msgid "Original 5.8.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8408
msgid ""
"The local image proxy has been added, and images displayed within the "
"client are now affected by the ``AllowUntrustedInternalConnections`` "
"setting. See [documentation](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/image-proxy.html#local-image-proxy) for more details if you have trouble"
" loading images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8411
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from another release than 5.7, please read the [Important "
"Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8416
msgid "Added support for LDAP Group Sync"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8417
msgid ""
"Lets admins set default team and channel membership based on LDAP groups."
" See more details [in the "
"documentation](https://docs.mattermost.com/deployment/ldap-group-"
"sync.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8419
msgid "Added multi-factor authentication support to Team Edition"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8420
msgid ""
"See more details on [this Forum post](https://forum.mattermost.com/t"
"/multi-factor-authentication-mfa-in-team-edition/6287)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8422
msgid "Enhanced image performance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8423
msgid ""
"Improved performance for images by adding support for image proxy "
"servers, which are now integrated into the server and switched on by "
"default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8424
msgid ""
"Note that this may cause problems loading images from within your local "
"network due to security settings. See "
"[here](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/image-proxy.html#local-"
"image-proxy) for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8429
msgid ""
"Improved sorting of emoji in the emoji autocomplete and emoji picker "
"search results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8430
msgid "Added support for emoji picker for mobile web view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8433
msgid "Added a channel notification setting to disable at-channel mentions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8436
msgid ""
"Added the ability to search users by role in **System Console** > "
"**Users**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8437
msgid "Added a CLI command to modify an outgoing webhook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8438
msgid "Added a CLI command to restore a team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8441
msgid ""
"Added network connectivity improvements where the server no longer allows"
" clients to auto-retry posts and to cause posts to appear twice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8443
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8643
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:9431
