msgid "Under ``\"LdapSettings\"`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8469
msgid ""
"Added ``\"GroupFilter\": \"\"``, ``\"GroupDisplayNameAttribute\": \"\"`` "
"and ``\"GroupIdAttribute\": \"\"``, to add the ability to configure group"
" display name and unique identifier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8470
msgid "Under ``\"ImageProxySettings\":`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8471
msgid ""
"Added ``\"Enable\": true,``, ``\"ImageProxyType\": \"local\",``, "
"``\"RemoteImageProxyURL\": \"\",`` and ``\"RemoteImageProxyOptions\": "
"\"\"``, to allow integrating image proxy into the server and switching it"
" on by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8473
msgid ""
"Added ``\"LinkMetadataTimeoutMilliseconds\": 5000`` and "
"``\"DisablePostMetadata\": false``, to enable post metadata by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8478
msgid "Added ``SearchTeams`` to plugin API to add the ability to search teams."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8479
msgid ""
"Added ``GetTeamStats`` to plugin API to add the ability to get team "
"statistics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8480
msgid ""
"Added ``/api/v4/posts/ids/reactions`` API endpoint to get the bulk "
"reactions for posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8481
msgid ""
"Added ``UpdateUserActive`` to plugin API to allow updating user's status "
"as active or inactive."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:8482
msgid "Add ``GetFile`` to plugin to add the ability to get files."
msgstr ""

