#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10384
msgid "Release v4.4.5 - Feature Release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10386
msgid "**v4.4.5, release date 2017-12-11**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10387
msgid ""
"Mattermost v4.4.5 contains a medium severity security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"highly recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 14 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10388
msgid "**v4.4.4, release date 2017-12-06**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10389
msgid ""
"Added a config.json setting, `ClientDirectory`, to set the directory to "
"write web app plugins to. Added to better support plugins in GitLab "
"Omnibus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10390
msgid "**v4.4.3, released 2017-12-05**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10391
#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10634
msgid ""
"Fixed a medium level security issue affecting servers with "
"[EnableOAuthServiceProvider](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/config-settings.html#enable-oauth-2-0-service-provider) set to `true` "
"and  "
"[EnableOnlyAdminIntegrations](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration"
"/config-settings.html#restrict-managing-integrations-to-admins) set to "
"`false`. If you're affected, "
"[upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/upgrade.html) is "
"highly recommended. Details will be posted on our [security updates "
"page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 14 days after release as "
"per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure Policy](https://mattermost.com"
"/security-vulnerability-report/?redirect_source=mm-org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10392
msgid "**v4.4.2, released 2017-11-23**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10393
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where AD/LDAP accounts get deactivated following an "
"AD/LDAP sync if their email address between the AD/LDAP server and "
"Mattermost don't match case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10394
msgid "Fixed synchronization of SAML accounts with AD/LDAP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10395
msgid ""
"Fixed AD/LDAP \"Test Connection\" button in the System Console not "
"working when AD/LDAP login is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10396
msgid ""
"Fixed system messages not being translated into user's language set in "
"**Account Settings > Display > Language**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10397
msgid ""
"Fixed system messages about channel header updates sometimes being "
"incorrectly formatted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10398
msgid "**v4.4.1, released 2017-11-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10399
msgid ""
"Fixed an upgrade issue where an alternative config file location via "
"``--config`` flag is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10400
msgid "**v4.4.0, released 2017-11-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10401
msgid "Original 4.4.0 release"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10406
msgid ""
"Beta release of Mattermost plugins, which allow admins to more easily "
"integrate with third-party systems, extend functionality and customize "
"the user interface of your Mattermost server. See the "
"[plugin](https://docs.mattermost.com/about/integrations.html#plugins) "
"documentation to learn more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10408
msgid "Do Not Disturb Status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10409
msgid ""
"Added \"Do Not Disturb\" status to temporarily turn off all desktop and "
"mobile push notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10411
msgid ""
"Support SAML sync via AD/LDAP ([Enterprise Edition "
"E20](https://mattermost.com/pricing/))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10412
msgid ""
"Added support for periodically synchronizing SAML user attributes, "
"including user deactivation and removal, from AD/LDAP. See "
"[documentation](https://docs.mattermost.com/onboard/ad-ldap.html) to "
"learn more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10417
msgid ""
"Added an experimental feature to hide direct and group message channels "
"after 7 days with no new messages. To enable it set "
"`CloseUnusedDirectMessages` in `config.json` to `true`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10418
msgid ""
"Moved website previews out of beta, configurable in **Account Settings > "
"Display**. Enable link previews in the [System "
"Console](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration/config-settings.html"
"#enable-link-previews)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10419
msgid ""
"Made it easier to add a user to channel if mentioned user is not already "
"a channel member."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10420
msgid ""
"Added \"Edit Account Settings\" link to the bottom of your own profile "
"popover to more easily edit your settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10421
msgid ""
"URL address for internal links such as when hovering over the flag icon, "
"is now hidden for better user experience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10422
msgid ""
"URL addresses for channels on the left-hand sidebar are now hidden on the"
" desktop app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10423
msgid ""
"Added a loading spinner to Account Settings dialog after clicking the "
"\"Save\" button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10424
msgid ""
"Added full date tooltip to post timestamps in right-hand sidebar and "
"search results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10425
msgid "Added \"@\" in front of the username field in user lists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10428
msgid ""
"Reduced load times by optimizing database queries and adding composite "
"indexes for the `Posts` table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:10429
msgid ""
