"New features, improvements, and bug fixes recommended by the GitLab "
"community were incorporated into Mattermost v0.7.0 Beta1--in particular, "
"extending support of GitLab SSO to team creation, and restricting team "
"creation to users with verified emails from a configurable list of "
"domains."
msgstr ""

