msgid "Slack Import (Preview)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15351
msgid ""
"Preview of Slack import functionality supports the processing of an "
"\"Export\" file from Slack containing account information and public "
"channel archives from a Slack team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15353
msgid ""
"In the feature preview, emails and usernames from Slack are used to "
"create new Mattermost accounts, which users can activate by going to the "
"Password Reset screen in Mattermost to set new credentials."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15354
msgid ""
"Once logged in, users will have access to previous Slack messages shared "
"in public channels, now imported to Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15356
msgid "Limitations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15358
msgid ""
"Slack does not export files or images your team has stored in Slack's "
"database. Mattermost will provide links to the location of your assets in"
" Slack's web UI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15359
msgid ""
"Slack does not export any content from private groups or direct messages "
"that your team has stored in Slack's database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/unsupported-legacy-releases.md:15360
msgid ""
"The Preview release of Slack Import does not offer pre-checks or roll-"
"back and will not import Slack accounts with username or email address "
"collisions with existing Mattermost accounts. Also, Slack channel names "
"with underscores will not import. Also, mentions do not yet resolve as "
"Mattermost usernames (still show Slack ID). These issues are being "
"addressed in [Mattermost v0.8.0 Migration "
"Support](https://mattermost.atlassian.net/issues/MM-364?filter=10002)."
